Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.69,0:01:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.45,0:02:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is this？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.78,0:02:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your Majesty，caught him up in a fishing net。A fishing net.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.45,0:02:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sire，he's been telling stories。Stories that…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.52,0:02:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,We believe he's found a…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.43,0:02:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ponce de Leon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.54,0:02:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Says he found Ponce de Leon's ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.97,0:02:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Or sailed on it。- No，I told you，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.84,0:03:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ponce de Leon died 200 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.24,0:03:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye，but he died searching for something，didn't he？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.48,0:03:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Fountain of Youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.32,0:03:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,How soon can you sail？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.39,0:03:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,With the tide.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.58,0:03:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Over here！Lucky heather！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.01,0:03:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pirate swords！Pirate swords！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.15,0:03:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pirate's execution today。Watch him swing！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.69,0:03:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pirate puppets！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.19,0:03:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take that，you！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.36,0:03:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hurry，Papa，or we'll miss the hanging！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.29,0:03:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not a hanging，dear，it's a trial。The hanging comes this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.16,0:03:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pirate hanging today！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.73,0:04:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Up you get.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.74,0:04:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move along，pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.24,0:04:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or should I say，「Captain Pirate」？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.24,0:04:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Come on！Up you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.58,0:04:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quiet！Order！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.92,0:04:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quiet！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.12,0:04:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now appearing before the court，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.05,0:04:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,the notorious and infamous pirate，pillager，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.42,0:04:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- and highwayman… - Quiet！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.96,0:04:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,…Captain Jack Sparrow！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.90,0:04:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you，the name's Gibbs！Joshamee Gibbs！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.57,0:04:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How many times… - Hear ye，hear ye！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.54,0:04:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Presiding over these trials，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.97,0:04:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,all rise and attend，the Right Honorable Justice Smith！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.25,0:04:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,My dear sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.33,0:05:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quiet！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.70,0:05:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.10,0:05:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,…what do we have here？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.24,0:05:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jack？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.67,0:05:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut up！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.01,0:05:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't recognize him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.11,0:05:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not necessary。You were saying？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.44,0:05:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jack Sparrow is not my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.25,0:05:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,My name is Joshamee Gibbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.28,0:05:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that so？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.15,0:05:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It says Jack Sparrow here。- I told 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.32,0:05:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not Jack Sparrow，who I would be happy to identify to the court
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.62,0:05:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- if it would help my case。- I think that would be a poor defense，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.66,0:05:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,unless you want to be bludgeoned again like a harp seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.06,0:05:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,The prisoner claims of being innocent
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.80,0:05:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,to being Jack Sparrow。How do you find？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.04,0:05:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,No trial？But aren't we here to examine the evidence…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.20,0:05:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Foreman，your finding。Guilty？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.87,0:05:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guilty verdict means he'll hang.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.48,0:05:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hang him！String him up！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.35,0:05:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Guilty？- That's not fair！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:05:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.09,0:06:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Joshamee Gibbs，the crime of which you've been found guilty of
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.96,0:06:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,is being innocent of being Jack Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.43,0:06:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hereby commute your sentence，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.36,0:06:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,and order that you be imprisoned for the remainder
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.17,0:06:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,of your miserable，moribund，mutton-chopped life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.17,0:06:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？！- Hang him！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.24,0:06:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hang him！- There.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.17,0:06:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Balderdash！- String him up！Hang him high！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.58,0:06:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Means shall be arranged to transport this prisoner
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.38,0:06:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,to the Tower of London.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.79,0:06:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.60,0:06:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ta.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.60,0:06:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Get up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.61,0:06:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get up！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.05,0:07:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hell's teeth。Now we're both headed for prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.82,0:07:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not to worry。I've paid off the driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.69,0:07:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ten minutes，we'll be outside London Town，horses waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.16,0:07:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tonight，we make the coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.83,0:07:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then it's just a matter of finding a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.46,0:07:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- All part of the plan，yes？- Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.27,0:07:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I arrived in London Town just this morning
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.37,0:07:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,to rescue one Joshamee Gibbs from one appointment with the gallows.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.64,0:07:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seeing as how you're still alive，
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.57,0:07:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd say it's all been very successful thus far.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.98,0:07:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,What happened to you，Gibbs？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.31,0:07:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought you were employed elsewhere or otherwise engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.05,0:07:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye。But I always listened like a thief for news of the Black Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.65,0:07:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody's seen where she might next make port.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.25,0:07:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then，I hear a rumor：
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.46,0:07:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jack Sparrow's in London with a ship and looking for a crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.09,0:07:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Am not。- But that's what I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.96,0:07:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fact is，you're signing up men tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.33,0:07:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pub called The Captain's Daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.00,0:07:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Am not！- Well，I thought it a bit odd，
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.40,0:07:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,but then，you've never been the most predictable of sorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.97,0:08:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.41,0:08:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,There is another Jack Sparrow out there sullying my good name？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.08,0:08:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- An impostor。- Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.35,0:08:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,But… an impostor with a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.22,0:08:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,And in need of a crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.96,0:08:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Which，as fate would have it，so am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.99,0:08:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about you，Jack？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.76,0:08:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Last I heard，you were hell-bent to find the Fountain of Youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.76,0:08:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any luck？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.33,0:08:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Circumstances arose and forced a compelling insight
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.44,0:08:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,regarding discretion and valor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.54,0:08:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Meaning，you gave up。- I did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.81,0:08:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am just as bent as ever。Hellishly so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.78,0:08:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I shall taste those waters，Master Gibbs。Mark my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.35,0:08:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Short trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.26,0:08:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,All part of the plan，yes？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.50,0:09:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.89,0:10:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are Jack Sparrow？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.50,0:10:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,There should be a 「Captain」 in there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.93,0:10:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've heard of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.60,0:10:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.67,0:10:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Face is familiar。Have I threatened you before？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.37,0:10:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are in the presence of George Augustus，Duke of Brunswick-Luneburg，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.31,0:10:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Archtreasurer and Prince-elector of the Holy Roman Empire，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.31,0:10:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,King of Great Britain and Ireland，and of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.18,0:10:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Doesn't ring a bell。- I am informed
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.69,0:11:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,you have come to London to procure a crew for your ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.96,0:11:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Vicious rumor。Not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.59,0:11:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then you lied to me when you told me you were Jack Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.83,0:11:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am Jack Sparrow，but I'm not here to procure a crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.20,0:11:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,That is… someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.80,0:11:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone else named Jack Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.04,0:11:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've brought me the wrong wastrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.38,0:11:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Find the proper one and dispose of this impostor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.81,0:11:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，wait，wait，wait。Hang on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.02,0:11:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm Jack Sparrow，the one and only.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.55,0:11:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I am in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.39,0:11:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,To procure a crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.62,0:11:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,To undertake a voyage
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.43,0:11:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- to the Fountain… - What？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.03,0:11:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will someone please remove these infernal chains？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.73,0:11:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come，come.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.37,0:11:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,We know you're in possession of a map.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.90,0:11:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,So confiscate the map，and to the gallows with him！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.21,0:11:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you a map？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.48,0:12:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No。- Where is it？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.58,0:12:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,The truth？I lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.42,0:12:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Quite recently，in fact。- I have a report.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Spanish have located the Fountain of Youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.33,0:12:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will not have some melancholy Spanish monarch，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.57,0:12:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,a Catholic，gain eternal life！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.27,0:12:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,You do know the way to the Fountain？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.81,0:12:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course I do。Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.11,0:12:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,You could guide an expedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.08,0:12:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,With your permission，your heinie，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.79,0:12:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,you will be providing，then，a ship…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.09,0:12:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and a crew？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.59,0:12:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,And a captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.24,0:13:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Afternoon，sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.48,0:13:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I may be so bold，why is that man not in chains？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.48,0:13:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,He must be manacled at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.52,0:13:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,At the center of my palace？Hardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.29,0:13:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hector.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.59,0:13:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,How nice to see a fellow pirate make good of himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.20,0:13:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pirate？Nay。Privateer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.50,0:13:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,On a sanctioned mission under the authority and protection of the Crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.20,0:13:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,As may be，but first，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.84,0:13:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,what has become of my beloved Pearl？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.18,0:13:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,I lost the Pearl as I lost my leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.45,0:13:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Lost the Pearl？- Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.85,0:13:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,I defended her mightily enough，but she be sunk nonetheless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.43,0:13:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,If that ship be sunk properly，you should be sunk with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.03,0:14:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain Barbossa，each second we tarry，the Spanish outdistance us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.47,0:14:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have every confidence you will prevail and be rewarded
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.04,0:14:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,with the high station you so desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.51,0:14:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- To serve doth suffice，sire。- You，sir，have stooped.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.38,0:14:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jack，our sands be all but run.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.88,0:14:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's the harm in joining the winning side？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.35,0:14:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you do meet a nicer class of person.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.26,0:14:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,I understand everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.03,0:14:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Except that wig.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.80,0:14:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's getting away！Stop him！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.01,0:14:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Head him off！- No！Stop that pirate！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.56,0:15:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come down！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.84,0:15:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He escaped？- Leave it to me，sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.75,0:15:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guards！Guards！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.94,0:15:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Arms at ready！- Aye，sir！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.32,0:16:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Find him！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.81,0:16:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Finders keepers！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.71,0:16:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,There！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.47,0:16:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that it？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.14,0:16:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Halt！Stop that carriage！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.61,0:16:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Head him off！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.89,0:17:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Out of the way！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.35,0:17:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop that pirate！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.69,0:17:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move out of the way！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.00,0:17:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop that man！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.67,0:17:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't let him get away！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.81,0:18:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fire！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.90,0:18:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's getting away！After him！Stop him！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.84,0:18:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,After him！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.16,0:18:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Filthy pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.34,0:19:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Jackie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.31,0:19:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.82,0:19:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I heard you're putting together a crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.62,0:19:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,If enough people keep saying it，it must be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.62,0:19:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,I heard where you're headed。The Fountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.53,0:19:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you been there？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.96,0:19:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Does this face look like it's been to the Fountain of Youth？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.63,0:19:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Depends on the light。- Son，the Fountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.97,0:19:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,There'll be items required for the profane ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.91,0:19:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two chalices.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.34,0:19:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- On the map there was a chalice。- Two，silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.88,0:19:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,From the Ponce de Leon ship。You'll need both.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.88,0:19:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- For？- The ritual。Don't be a fool，Jackie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.65,0:19:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Find out every detail before you set sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.86,0:19:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，set sail。Love to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.86,0:19:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,But for that，I may need a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.23,0:20:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Those folk，over there，they have a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.66,0:20:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're signing up sailors right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.37,0:20:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ My heart is pierced by Cupid ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.70,0:20:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I disdain all glittering gold ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.84,0:20:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,And one last thing，Jackie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.54,0:20:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Fountain will test you。Mark my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.04,0:20:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ My heart is pierced by Cupid ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.51,0:20:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I disdain all glittering gold ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.58,0:20:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ There is nothing can console me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.48,0:20:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ But my jolly sailor bold ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.20,0:20:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hear you be recruiting a crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.57,0:20:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye。That is，
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.77,0:20:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jack Sparrow be putting together a modest venture.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.31,0:20:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got some nerve，ain't ya？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.78,0:20:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Turning up here dressed like that？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.45,0:20:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you，some kind of impostor？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.58,0:20:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you any idea who I am，mate？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.19,0:21:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oi，muckers！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.72,0:21:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a bloke here what's forgotten his own name！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.13,0:21:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lads，I'm sailing with Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.53,0:21:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who'll buy a sailor a drink？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.90,0:21:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's next？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.34,0:21:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bring us some more of those ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.58,0:21:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，make it four.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.26,0:21:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've stolen me，and I'm here to take meself back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.80,0:22:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.42,0:23:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only one person alive knows that move.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.93,0:24:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Always wanted to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.10,0:24:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Angelica.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.11,0:24:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Jack。Are you impressed？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.14,0:24:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I almost killed you once or twice there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.48,0:24:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm touched at this most sincerest form of flattery.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.99,0:24:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,But why？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.39,0:24:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were the only pirate I thought I would pass for.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.16,0:24:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,That is not a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.33,0:24:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry，Jack。I forgave you a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.13,0:24:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- For what？For leaving you？- Recall that I left you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.44,0:24:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,A gentleman allows a lady to maintain her fictions.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.48,0:24:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，Sparrow。As long as my sailors get their money，
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.15,0:24:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,they're willing to put up with any number of peculiarities.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.32,0:24:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,There is one peculiarity with which I will not put up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.65,0:24:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will be impersonated as 「Captain.」 Nothing less.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.86,0:24:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，for that，you need a ship，
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.03,0:25:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,and as it turns out，I have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.46,0:25:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I could use a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.53,0:25:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hear tell you've been to the Fountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.43,0:25:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,There be a lot of hear-telling going on these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.70,0:25:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The Fountain of Youth。- Dearest Angelica，fret not.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.37,0:25:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,You still have a few usable years left.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.48,0:25:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Always so charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.78,0:25:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,You didn't answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.02,0:25:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye。Regarding the Fountain。Waste of time，really…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.72,0:25:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Milady，I see unseamanlike fellows of an officious-looking nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.49,0:25:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wretched pirates！Find 'em！Maggots！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.36,0:25:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Friends of yours？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.66,0:25:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,I may have unintentionally slighted some king or other.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.47,0:25:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Open it！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.37,0:25:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah，you haven't changed。- Implying the need？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.17,0:25:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.67,0:25:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Open this door，in the name of His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.51,0:25:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,You betrayed me。You seduced me and you used me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.01,0:25:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was innocent of the ways of men.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.88,0:25:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,You demonstrated a lot of technique for someone I supposedly corrupted.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.28,0:25:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Imminent danger。Here，now，milady！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.22,0:26:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Open it！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.99,0:26:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was ready to take my vows。And you…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.69,0:26:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,What were you doing in a Spanish convent，anyway？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.49,0:26:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mistook it for a brothel。Honest mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.17,0:26:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- There he is！- Over there！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.22,0:26:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,We are at a disadvantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.29,0:26:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Speak for yourself。Unlike some who pretend to be，
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.86,0:26:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,but cannot，in fact，hold a candle to，
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.76,0:26:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am Captain Jack Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.43,0:27:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,How can you say I used you？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.14,0:27:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know exactly how.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.47,0:27:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know，but how can you say it？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.25,0:27:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So，what is it？- What is what？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.92,0:27:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,About the Fountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.02,0:27:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you know？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.02,0:27:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't happen to be in possession
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.73,0:27:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,of two silver chalices，circa Ponce de Leon？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.70,0:27:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No。- Thought not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.70,0:27:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why？- I hear stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.47,0:27:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.40,0:27:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are，of course，aware of the ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.54,0:28:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.98,0:28:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is it？What is required？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.32,0:28:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,A mermaid，Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.29,0:28:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's been a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.83,0:28:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a life sentence，not death。Life！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.77,0:28:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Barbossa。- Thank you，gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.24,0:28:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I trust you can tie a noose.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.38,0:28:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's a hard thing，
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.91,0:28:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,forcing a man to twist his own hanging rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.75,0:28:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,You must lie in your bed the way you made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.42,0:28:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's happened to you？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.92,0:28:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where be Jack Sparrow？- He escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.46,0:28:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm on a tight schedule，Gibbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.06,0:28:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,The HMS Providence sets sail at first light.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.56,0:28:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you do not care to watch it hanging here dead，
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.87,0:29:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,with a mouth full of flies…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.54,0:29:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,…speak now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.91,0:29:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take me with you。Any point of the compass…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.54,0:29:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take you where，Gibbs？The Fountain？Aye？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.48,0:29:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that where Jack be headed？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.68,0:29:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you anything you can offer me，Gibbs？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.82,0:29:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anything at all？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.16,0:29:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Upon me naked word，you'll not see the dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.70,0:29:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hand it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.18,0:29:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You fool！- I had just enough time
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.61,0:29:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,to study those infernal circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.25,0:29:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Every route，every destination。All safe… in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.39,0:29:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Welcome back to His Majesty's navy，Master Gibbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.50,0:30:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Show a leg，sailor！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.64,0:30:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.41,0:30:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.84,0:30:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- There's been a horrible mistake。- Keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.55,0:30:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm not supposed to be here。- Many a man's woken up at sea，
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.65,0:30:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,no idea what，when，wherefore or why.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.75,0:30:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,No memory of the night afore，whence he signed up
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.12,0:30:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,and drank away all his bonus money.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.79,0:30:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no。You don't understand，mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.89,0:30:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm Captain Jack Sparrow。The original。The only.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.46,0:30:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scrum，and the pleasure's all mine。Now，keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.54,0:30:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scrum.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.14,0:30:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get your elbows in！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.88,0:30:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why is there a glass coffin？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.88,0:30:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do I look like a man in charge？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.48,0:31:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where am I？- 'Scuse me，Captain Sparrow，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.55,0:31:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I be right honored to welcome you aboard
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.36,0:31:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,our world-renowned vessel of infamy，Queen Anne's Revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.03,0:31:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blackbeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.05,0:31:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Work！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.72,0:31:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He's a curious one。- He's been zombiefied.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.95,0:31:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.73,0:31:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Zombiefied.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.39,0:31:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blackbeard's doing。All the officers are the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.03,0:31:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Makes 'em more compliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.03,0:31:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,And perpetually ill-tempered.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.70,0:31:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on。Scrub。- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.38,0:32:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pull！Pull！Pull！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.55,0:32:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Five days underway，at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.26,0:32:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye。You can tell that by the smell of the sea？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.23,0:32:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Smell of the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.53,0:32:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oi。What did that poor sod do？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.77,0:32:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,And how can I make sure to not？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.94,0:32:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Him？Churchly fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.41,0:32:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Always going on about the Lord Almighty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.58,0:32:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bible-thumper on this ship？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.45,0:32:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,A missionary is his story.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.48,0:32:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,What I heard was he got captured in a raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.35,0:32:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rest of the ship got killed，but not 'im.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.35,0:32:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,First mate wouldn't let it happen
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.82,0:32:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,on account of his premier standing with the Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.66,0:32:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,A first mate sticking her neck out for some prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.23,0:32:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,That you don't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.96,0:32:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Her」？First mate is a 「her」？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.80,0:32:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Back to work！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.34,0:33:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Steady as she goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.83,0:33:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are a ruthless，soulless，cross-grained cur.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.33,0:33:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I told you I had a ship。- No，Blackbeard has a ship，
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.97,0:33:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,upon which I am now imprisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.94,0:33:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,We can do this，Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.04,0:33:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Fountain of Youth，like you always wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.75,0:33:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blackbeard。Edward Teach。The pirate all pirates fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.02,0:33:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Resurrector of the dead in his spare time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.32,0:33:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He will listen to me。- He listens to no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.32,0:33:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe to his own daughter？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.76,0:33:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Daughter as in… beget by？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.56,0:34:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Long-lost。Recently found.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.54,0:34:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who loves her dear papa with all her soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.51,0:34:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He bought that？- I sold that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.02,0:34:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then it's the Fountain of Youth for him，
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.98,0:34:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,or him and you，not you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.99,0:34:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Jack，that's the best part.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.19,0:34:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,He will be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.56,0:34:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll be handling that part yourself，then？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.10,0:34:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,There is a prophecy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.46,0:34:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe you don't believe in the supernatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.80,0:34:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no，no。I've seen a thing or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.87,0:34:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,The prophecy is this：
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.01,0:34:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blackbeard will meet his death within a fortnight
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.95,0:34:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,at the hands of a one-legged man.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.55,0:34:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's why he needs the Fountain，Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.07,0:35:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Master Gibbs，short we are a map.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.97,0:35:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perhaps you'd be so kind as to provide us an heading.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.85,0:35:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Be a gem and pour me a gulper.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.08,0:35:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nay。We be privateers，not pirates，Master Gibbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.65,0:35:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,And in the king's name，we behave as such.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.92,0:35:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.16,0:35:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Be we on the proper course，Gibbs？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.10,0:35:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye，it be proper。There's your proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.21,0:35:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Spaniard.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.08,0:35:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,All hands！Battle stations！Get to windward！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.95,0:35:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- All hands，windward！- Harden up two points！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.15,0:36:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Two points！- Cast loose the cannons！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.56,0:36:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Gunners，take posts！- Take position！Gunners ready，sir！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.46,0:36:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Out！Thrust！- Await orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.43,0:36:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Steady！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.14,0:36:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guns armed，awaiting orders，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.51,0:36:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir。Orders，sir？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.69,0:36:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,He never so much as turned his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.56,0:36:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Fountain is the prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.56,0:36:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,It appears we be not even worth the time it'd take to sink us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.33,0:36:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now we've fallen behind。All hands，make more sail！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.37,0:36:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,All hands，more sail！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.07,0:36:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ride hard between wind and tide！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.38,0:37:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,The topic，gentlemen，is mutiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.75,0:37:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mutiny most foul.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.69,0:37:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye。I signed up to sail under Jack Sparrow，not some pretender.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.36,0:37:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,And a lady，at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.76,0:37:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,And mention was failed to be made of this uncanny crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.10,0:37:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Make my toes curl，they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.60,0:37:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got 'em。All of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.84,0:37:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Well done。- Good lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.91,0:37:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,On to it，then。Blackbeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.51,0:37:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What are his habits？- Stays mostly to his cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.08,0:37:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right，mostly to his cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.98,0:37:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes，but when he comes out… - He don't really come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.19,0:37:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,He must come out sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.42,0:37:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not really，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.46,0:37:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any of you sail with him before？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.29,0:37:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No，no。- I've never.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.89,0:37:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Definitely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.06,0:37:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Any of you seen him before？- Not really，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.53,0:37:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stays to his cabin，no one sailed with him，
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.87,0:37:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,no one's seen him…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.07,0:38:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good news，gentlemen。This is not Blackbeard's ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.21,0:38:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is not the Queen Anne's Revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.14,0:38:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，this be the Queen Anne's Revenge，right enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.31,0:38:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do you know？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.91,0:38:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've seen the name，on the back of the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.42,0:38:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gentlemen，sirs，fellow conscriptees…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.13,0:38:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,…you have been monstrously deceived.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.36,0:38:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We are decepted，then？- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.67,0:38:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've nay been informed of a destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.70,0:38:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Death lies before us
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.01,0:38:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,as we sail for the Fountain of Youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.65,0:38:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,It would be a sorry plight，mates.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.48,0:38:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Death，for certain。- The garden of darkened souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.72,0:38:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Untimely our ends will be。- Unless…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.26,0:38:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,…we take the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.06,0:38:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,We take the ship，then。Now！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.83,0:39:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go on，then.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.14,0:39:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Help me，shipmates！- Give it to 'em！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.94,0:39:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Wake up！It's ours！- Come on！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.31,0:39:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get up！Off your backside！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.51,0:39:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get off your fannies！- Take it to them，lads！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.01,0:39:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help me！Fight！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.40,0:39:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.43,0:39:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,If this is a dream，you can keep the sword and boots on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.21,0:39:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- If it's not… - It's a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.35,0:39:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，it's not！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.72,0:39:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought I should give you fair warning，we're taking the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.32,0:39:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.89,0:39:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Think you might be better off if you just…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.43,0:40:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,…stay out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.35,0:40:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boggit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.14,0:40:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wretch！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.17,0:41:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're either with us or against us！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.31,0:41:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am not with you，neither am I against you！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.64,0:41:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can he do that？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.14,0:41:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's religious。I believe it's required.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.49,0:41:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fight to the bitter end，you cack-handed deck apes！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.63,0:41:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take him，men。Tie him down tight！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.78,0:42:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,The ship is ours！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.35,0:42:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.03,0:42:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I be placed in a bewilderment.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.63,0:42:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,There I were，resting，
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.43,0:42:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,and upon a sudden，I hear an ungodly row on deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.17,0:43:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sailors abandon their posts
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.24,0:43:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,without orders，without leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.88,0:43:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Men before the mast，
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.25,0:43:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,taking the ship for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.39,0:43:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,What be that，First Mate？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.86,0:43:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mutiny，Captain。- Again？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.86,0:43:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mutiny！- Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.40,0:43:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mutiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.60,0:43:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,And what fate befalls mutineers？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.20,0:43:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，we know the answer to that，do we not？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.87,0:43:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mutineers hang！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.26,0:44:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain，I wish to report a mutiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.50,0:44:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can name fingers and point names.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.27,0:44:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,No need，Mr。Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.87,0:44:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,They are sheep。You，their shepherd.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.01,0:44:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have I mentioned，sir，what a lovely daughter you have？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.35,0:44:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,A fitting last sight for a doomed soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.95,0:44:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remember，Father。We need him.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.48,0:44:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I don't kill a man every now and then，
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.09,0:44:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- they forget who I am。- Coward！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.16,0:45:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,They do not forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.49,0:45:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your crew sees you for the miscreant you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.00,0:45:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,A coward，no matter how many you slay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.43,0:45:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Twice in one day，I find myself in a bewilderment.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.00,0:45:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are not bewildered，you are afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.84,0:45:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,You dare not walk the path of righteousness，the way of the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.31,0:45:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，sir。The truth is it be much simpler than all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.68,0:45:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I am a bad man。- That，too.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.71,0:45:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I might have to kill you too，catechist.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.85,0:45:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No！- All Latin blood like her mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.58,0:45:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Father，I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.79,0:45:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,There I be again，forgetting why the missionary is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.69,0:45:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,My daughter fears for my soul，or what's left of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.10,0:45:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,You truly wish to save me，my child？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.90,0:45:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Every soul can be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.90,0:45:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Be that true，young cleric？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.90,0:45:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。Though you I see as a bit of a long shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.61,0:45:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Still，I pray for every unfortunate soul on this hell-bound vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.12,0:45:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,You disarm me with your faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.15,0:46:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Eight bells！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.76,0:46:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Which of you unfortunate souls stood watch？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.89,0:46:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I did。I stood watch。- Gunner.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.24,0:46:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,You？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.30,0:46:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.47,0:46:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.41,0:46:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,The cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.51,0:46:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perfect。Lower the longboat！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.65,0:46:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bring her about！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.20,0:46:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why do you do this？- Mutiny。Our laws be clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.40,0:46:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our laws allow the Captain to show leniency.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.80,0:46:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have given this man a chance to determine his fate，
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.54,0:46:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,a gift not afforded to all.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.35,0:47:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.12,0:47:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chance to show the worth of your prayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.86,0:47:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pray he be delivered from… evil？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.24,0:47:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Course made！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.77,0:47:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop。Give that man a chance。Give yourself a…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.33,0:47:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know when I feel closest to our Maker？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.07,0:47:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,When I see suffering，pain and anguish.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.07,0:47:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's when the true design of this world is revealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.74,0:48:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I see it revealed when in times of hardship and tragedy，
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.58,0:48:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,kindness and compassion are shown to those in need.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.01,0:48:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perhaps you should pray for him to be unharmed，yes？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.55,0:48:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Please，there's still hope… - Again！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.50,0:48:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I actually have no interest in the Fountain whatsoever，
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.20,0:48:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,so，if your heart is set，
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.20,0:48:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,you may drop me off anywhere you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.54,0:48:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,That'll be all，Quartermaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.31,0:48:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your words surround you like fog and make you hard to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.94,0:48:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,And what of you，the mighty Blackbeard？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.92,0:48:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Beheaded they say。Still，your body swam
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.85,0:48:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,three times around your ship，then climbed back onboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.42,0:48:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,And here you are，running scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.66,0:48:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Scared。- To the Fountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.23,0:48:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Quartermaster sees things before they happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.40,0:49:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,He has foreseen my death，and so the fates have spoken.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.00,0:49:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,The threads of destiny woven.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.54,0:49:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have a ridiculously high regard for fate，mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.61,0:49:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And you？- Me？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.34,0:49:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm skeptical of predicting any future… which includes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.78,0:49:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,It'd be foolish to battle fate，but I'd be tempted to cheat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.69,0:49:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will reach the Fountain。You will lead me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.03,0:49:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,That knife will serve you no better than the mutiny you devised.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.16,0:49:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mutiny served me well.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.10,0:49:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,It gained me an audience with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.04,0:49:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.67,0:49:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,To warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.44,0:49:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Regarding your first mate，
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.14,0:49:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,who pretends to be persons she is not.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.65,0:49:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.25,0:49:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,She is not your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.32,0:49:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,You dare to speak thusly of my flesh and blood？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.52,0:50:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，the woman is consummate in the art of deception.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.20,0:50:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know。As I mostly unwittingly set her on her wicked path.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.80,0:50:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Though I cannot claim credit
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.87,0:50:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,for her existing abundance of natural talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.84,0:50:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Angelica。My beloved daughter，
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.48,0:50:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,the one true good thing I have done in this life，
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.21,0:50:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,and you claim to be the one who corrupted her？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.02,0:50:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，what she is is pure evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.19,0:50:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,More to be feared than a wild beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.72,0:50:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hungry wild beast with gnashing teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.69,0:50:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Vengeful，hungry from hell beast…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.86,0:50:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Father？- Sweetness！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.97,0:50:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,No need to hurt him，Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.67,0:50:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,He will help us。Won't you，Jack？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.04,0:50:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see？Even now，she attends to your welfare，
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.91,0:50:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,giving lie to the claims you make of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.05,0:51:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,You will lead us to the Fountain。Yes？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.36,0:51:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.86,0:51:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I do not make it to the Fountain in time…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.90,0:51:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,…neither will you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.04,0:51:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll have a wee look-see at those charts straight away then，shall I？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.91,0:51:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.05,0:51:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Aye？- Captain，sir，
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.55,0:51:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am unhappy to report rumors，sir，
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.09,0:51:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,among the crew，as to our destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.46,0:51:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut your trap and make way.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.46,0:51:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That's the way of it，then。- No disrespect，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.90,0:51:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do the men fear？Say it。Speak the words.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.47,0:51:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whitecap Bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.94,0:51:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye，Whitecap Bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.18,0:52:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,And every worthless seaman fears the name，and rightly so，
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.41,0:52:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,though few know why or dare to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.92,0:52:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Be the stories true？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.72,0:52:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Say what robs you of your staunch heart，Gibbs，
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.65,0:52:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,or forever leave it to the wider fields of fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.49,0:52:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mermaids，Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.26,0:52:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye。Mermaids.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.16,0:52:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sea ghouls，devil fish，dreadful in hunger for flesh of man.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.47,0:52:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mermaid waters，that be our path.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.17,0:52:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cling to your soul，Gibbs，
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.87,0:52:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,as mermaids be given to take the rest…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.68,0:52:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,…to the bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.65,0:52:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Steady！Steady，men！Find your courage，
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.95,0:52:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,or be ready to purpose your fear！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.99,0:52:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Save yourselves！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.96,0:52:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Man overboard！- Nay！A deserter.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.96,0:52:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come about。- Nay！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.00,0:52:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gentlemen，I shall not ask any more of any man than what
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.97,0:52:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,that man can deliver，but I do ask this：Are we not king's men？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.57,0:53:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.17,0:53:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- On the king's mission？- Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.11,0:53:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I did not note any fear in the eyes of the Spanish as they passed us by.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.48,0:53:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Are we not king's men？- Aye！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.35,0:53:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye！Hands all off，and bear away！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.45,0:53:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stave on ahead to Whitecap Bay！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.02,0:53:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bear on，Whitecap Bay！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.37,0:53:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.01,0:53:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Little drink？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.48,0:53:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wine，music，candlelight.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.85,0:53:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think we've traveled down this road before，Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.22,0:53:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.02,0:53:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I remember it well.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.26,0:53:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Winding，twisting and turning，gyrating，writhing.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.23,0:53:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Incessant writhing.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.70,0:53:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you recall Saint Dominique？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.00,0:54:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,La Martinique.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.70,0:54:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I tried to kill you in Saint Dominique.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.54,0:54:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Either or.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.11,0:54:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hardly appropriate for a first mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.27,0:54:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Was I the first？I've often wondered.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.88,0:54:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can be so charming when you want something，Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.25,0:54:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,The trick is finding out what.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.85,0:54:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,The truth，then，is it？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.66,0:54:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blackbeard has served his purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.29,0:54:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,You and I can go to the Fountain together，
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.76,0:54:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,where we shall bathe one another in equal shares of fame
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.96,0:54:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,and other assorted debaucheries.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.13,0:54:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I'll tell you the ritual of the Fountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.27,0:54:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。The profane ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.81,0:54:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can I trust you，Jack？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.14,0:54:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I need you on my side。- Oh，my dearest Angelica.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.68,0:54:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,You and I are as thick as thieves，love.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.29,0:54:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell me the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.66,0:55:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Water from the Fountain of Youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.16,0:55:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,The shimmering tear of a mermaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.70,0:55:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,The silver chalices of Ponce de Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.97,0:55:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,With these items…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.84,0:55:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes？- With these items，
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.11,0:55:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,you may take all the years of life from another，Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.78,0:55:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.72,0:55:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,We cannot go alone，you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.79,0:55:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,The ritual requires a victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.79,0:55:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That is unfortunate。- Yes，it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.66,0:55:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I find my desire for the Fountain greatly lessened.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.93,0:55:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,But there is something onboard you do want.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.34,0:55:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about Blackbeard？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.84,0:55:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's in the chart room。We'll have to be quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.52,0:56:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,He keeps each ship as a prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.89,0:56:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,You help me，and I promise you your pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.50,0:56:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Though I think I know the one you will choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.77,0:56:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Black Pearl in a bottle？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.41,0:56:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why is the Black Pearl in a bottle？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.92,0:56:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's even more annoying in miniature.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.92,0:56:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Do we have a deal，Jack？- Angelica，I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.09,0:56:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are not going to steal the life of some innocent man.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.53,0:56:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about the one-legged man？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.06,0:56:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need years，Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.53,0:56:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not for me。For my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.57,0:56:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am truly the daughter of Blackbeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.91,0:57:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've fallen for your own con，love.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.25,0:57:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，he is my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.68,0:57:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,The lies I told you were not lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.15,0:57:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,You lied to me by telling me the truth？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.16,0:57:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes。- That's very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.36,0:57:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- May I use that？- I'm sure you will，anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.93,0:57:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.43,0:57:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，will you not give up this quest？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.73,0:57:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want a father，Jack。I haven't had one.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.10,0:57:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Angelica，your father，Blackbeard…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.94,0:57:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,…he is evil，
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.44,0:57:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,and he will kill you given the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.78,0:57:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He cannot be saved。- And who are you to set
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.05,0:57:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,the limits on redemption？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.38,0:57:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,You stole years of my life，Jack。You owe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.82,0:57:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you are en route to getting yourself killed，
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.06,0:57:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,and I am not inclined to stand by and watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.49,0:57:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whitecap Bay！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.34,0:58:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,All hands on deck！Set to the longboats！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.81,0:58:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lay 'em out flat！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.51,0:58:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,No tangles。Make 'em look pretty for our dainty guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.45,0:58:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're gonna need light。A lot of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.02,0:58:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.84,0:58:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Smell that？Whale oil。Stuff burns like a miracle from God.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.22,0:58:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Can you make it work？- Made by the English.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.12,0:58:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's not get our hopes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.23,0:59:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,The old moon in the arms of the new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.33,0:59:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,First of the summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.47,0:59:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perfect for hunting a mermaid's tear.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.95,0:59:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're doomed。They be drawn to man-made light.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.02,0:59:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sharks？- Worse than sharks，boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.86,0:59:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,There'll be mermaids upon us within the hour，
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.53,0:59:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,you mark my words。And we're the bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.64,0:59:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I heard it said a kiss from a mermaid protects a sailor from drowning.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.44,0:59:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't be a fool！Mermaids are all female，son，
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.44,0:59:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,and lovely as a dream of heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.38,0:59:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,But when it comes time to churn butter，so to speak，
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.79,0:59:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,they snatch a sailor out of a boat
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.92,0:59:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,or off the deck of a ship，have their way，
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.09,1:00:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,and then the sailors are pulled to bottom and drowned and eaten.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.46,1:00:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or，sometimes，the other way around.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.27,1:00:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sing。- What？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.20,1:00:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,They like to hear singing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.68,1:00:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ My name is Maria ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.41,1:00:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ A merchant's daughter fair ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.68,1:00:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Louder。- ∮ And I have left my parents ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.46,1:00:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ And 3，000 pounds a year ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.79,1:00:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ My heart is pierced by Cupid ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.96,1:00:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I disdain all glittering gold ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.57,1:00:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ There is nothing can console me ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.17,1:00:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ But my jolly sailor bold ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.81,1:00:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ My heart is pierced by Cupid ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.94,1:00:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I disdain all glittering gold ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.78,1:00:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ There is nothing can console me ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.65,1:01:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ But my jolly sailor bold ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.04,1:01:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lord save me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.81,1:01:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man，look。Look there.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.15,1:01:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll scare her off！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.38,1:01:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye，and good riddance！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.32,1:01:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you talk？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.03,1:01:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.84,1:01:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.64,1:01:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Are you the one who sings？- Aye.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.31,1:02:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you my jolly sailor bold？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.12,1:02:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Aye，that I be。- Scrum，comport yourself！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.05,1:02:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boys！There ain't much been given to me
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.69,1:02:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,in my brief，miserable life，there's the truth in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.23,1:02:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,But，by God，I'll have it said
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.09,1:02:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,that Scrum had himself a kiss from a proper mermaid！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.13,1:02:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ My heart is pierced by Cupid ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.04,1:02:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I disdain all glittering gold ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.21,1:02:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ There is nothing can console me ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.74,1:02:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ But my jolly sailor bold ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.35,1:02:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Come all ye pretty fair maids ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.69,1:02:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Whoever you may be ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.39,1:02:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ Who love a jolly sailor bold ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.09,1:02:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ That ploughs the raging sea ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.97,1:02:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ My heart is pierced by Cupid ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.24,1:03:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I disdain all glittering gold ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.57,1:03:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ There is nothing can console me ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.91,1:03:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ But my jolly sailor bold ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.42,1:03:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ My heart is pierced by Cupid ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.72,1:03:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ I disdain all glittering gold ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.09,1:03:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ There is nothing can console me ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.30,1:03:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ But my jolly sailor bold ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.24,1:04:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Out upon it！It has begun！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.15,1:04:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Light 'em up！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.18,1:04:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Muster your courage！Drive 'em to shore！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.20,1:05:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nets into the water！Quickly！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.15,1:06:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Retreat，all，to land！For your lives！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.89,1:06:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Retreat，I say！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.43,1:06:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cowards！Back in the water！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.59,1:06:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,There be no refuge on land！On my word！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.25,1:08:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got one！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.69,1:08:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm in love！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.80,1:08:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Check the wounded！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.36,1:08:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,See if you can find one mermaid still alive！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.44,1:09:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come，give a hand！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.84,1:09:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well done，sailor.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.84,1:09:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did everyone see that？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.65,1:09:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because I will not be doing it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.78,1:09:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Back to the ship。We head for a protected cove。Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.34,1:09:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Lord。Is that？- Mermaid.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.41,1:09:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Give up this madness now。- I cannot.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.81,1:09:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ever walk on the beach，
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.01,1:09:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,look back and see your footsteps in the sand？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.41,1:10:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's like that，except the footsteps lie before me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.55,1:10:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Footstep，actually。- Whitecap Bay，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.49,1:10:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,We must hasten.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.27,1:10:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,We travel by foot。Gibbs，I require a heading.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.94,1:10:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But，sir，the men。- They be dead already.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.24,1:10:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They don't sound dead。- Oh，is that so？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.48,1:10:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I hear nothing but seagulls nesting.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.95,1:10:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is it that you hear，Mr。Groves？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.78,1:10:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seagulls… nesting.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.62,1:10:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Nothing more。- Heading，Gibbs？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.33,1:10:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,My God.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.07,1:10:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your head or my heading.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.20,1:10:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll have me one or t'other，I don't care which.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.61,1:11:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,All hands，forward！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.33,1:11:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's to you now，Sparrow。- Was that really necessary？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.97,1:11:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Best you not know the exact whereabouts of my ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.77,1:11:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I be a cautious man。- So be I.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.57,1:11:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,What I want first…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.88,1:11:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,…is Ponce De Leon's ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.05,1:12:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why is it we've got to bring her along？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.02,1:12:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because tears don't keep。We need them fresh.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.39,1:12:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is the ritual again？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.26,1:12:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Water from the Fountain and a mermaid's tear？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.86,1:12:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,And two silver chalices.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.53,1:12:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,One cup with a tear，one without.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.44,1:12:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，one with a tear and water in both？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.97,1:12:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quite complicated，is it not？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.64,1:12:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Both get water。One gets a tear.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.88,1:12:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,The person who drinks the water with the tear
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.65,1:12:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,gets all the years of life from the other.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.32,1:12:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,How many years？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.85,1:12:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,All the years that they have lived，
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.96,1:12:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,and they could have lived，if fate had been kinder.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.80,1:13:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Clergyman.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.07,1:13:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,On the off chance that this does not go well for me，
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.14,1:13:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I would like it noted here and now
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.88,1:13:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,that I am fully prepared to believe in whatever I must，
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.25,1:13:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,so that I may be welcomed into that place
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.15,1:13:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,where all the goody-goodies get to go。Savvy？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.68,1:13:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have a word for that，Jack。You can convert.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.49,1:13:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was thinking more of an as-needed basis.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.96,1:13:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quartermaster！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.83,1:13:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Aye？- She cannot breathe！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.70,1:13:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- She has water。- She needs air！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.71,1:13:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Open this。- She will escape.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.81,1:13:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're killing her。- I support the missionary's position.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.05,1:14:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,See？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.19,1:14:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Onward.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.09,1:14:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just as I thought。Not this way！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.62,1:14:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is the way，isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.19,1:14:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,'Course it is，but we should go around to the east.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.16,1:14:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,That would take us out of the path of the chalices.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.16,1:14:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Well，then we'll circle back。- There is no time.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.07,1:14:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're the one who insisted on bringing the bloody mermaid.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.87,1:14:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Well，the mutiny didn't help。- You walk like a girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.00,1:14:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You would know。- Someone must go.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.17,1:14:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,You mean split up？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.84,1:14:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,You mean jump？This I cannot wait to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.88,1:15:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sparrow will go。Find the ship，retrieve the chalices.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.05,1:15:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sparrow？What makes you think he will come back？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.12,1:15:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，what makes you think he will come back？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.52,1:15:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,We cannot trust him，Father。I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.86,1:15:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,She'll go.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.60,1:15:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,How much farther to the Fountain？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.10,1:15:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.77,1:15:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,About a day's march north，following that river，
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.07,1:15:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,you'll get to a series of pools。Then you're close.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.04,1:15:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,You will go.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.21,1:15:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was sure it would come to this.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.10,1:15:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know that feeling you get sometimes when you're standing in a high place？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.40,1:15:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sudden urge to jump？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.24,1:15:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't have it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.17,1:16:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need those chalices.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.84,1:16:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shoot。Save me the bother of the fall.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.48,1:16:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,You will go。You will return…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.85,1:16:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,…or I will kill her.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.65,1:16:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,You won't kill your own daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.32,1:16:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quartermaster，get me six more pistols，
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.26,1:16:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,remove the shot from all but two，
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.99,1:16:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,but do not tell me which two.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.77,1:16:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,You get to choose，Mr。Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.14,1:16:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.54,1:16:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.68,1:16:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes。- You're sure？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.65,1:16:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,'Course I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.32,1:16:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Again.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.89,1:16:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please，they're not even loaded.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.37,1:17:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Again.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.50,1:17:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you're so keen on killing her，
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.54,1:17:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- why don't you just let her jump？- What？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.71,1:17:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you jump and die，
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.34,1:17:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,then she will have her chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.15,1:17:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Again.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.85,1:17:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oi…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.89,1:17:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,…if I jump，will I survive？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.06,1:17:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,The doll.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.75,1:17:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes，now you will survive。- This is nonsense！I'm going！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.24,1:18:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wet。Wet again.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.77,1:18:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,We go on。Due north to the Fountain.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.51,1:18:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well played，Father.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.61,1:18:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,You knew which guns were loaded，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.65,1:18:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course，my love.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.30,1:18:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Be nice to have a map about now.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.20,1:18:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or a ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.57,1:18:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop！Hold very still.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.74,1:18:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ye dare not let it touch your skin.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.99,1:19:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？What be wrong with an older man having a hobby？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.36,1:19:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you stopping for，eh？Push on！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.03,1:19:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Push on！- You can sleep when you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.36,1:19:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Push on！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.17,1:19:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fortune continues to favor us.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.30,1:19:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Santiago.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.67,1:19:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Famously captained by Ponce de Leno.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.17,1:19:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no one there.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.74,1:19:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right，then.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.44,1:20:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,We must not stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.88,1:20:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,You will walk.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.81,1:20:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I cannot.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.11,1:21:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Walk or die.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.35,1:21:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put your arms around me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.72,1:21:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I do not ask for help。- But you need it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.04,1:21:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We're in a hurry，yes？- Do not fall behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.66,1:21:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold here 'til I say！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.48,1:22:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Such beauty.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.48,1:22:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Surely you're one of God's own creations，
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.95,1:22:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,and not a descendant of those dark creatures
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.02,1:22:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,who found no refuge on the Ark.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.09,1:22:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Such beauty…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.49,1:22:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and yet deadly.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.10,1:22:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Deadly？No。- You attacked me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.70,1:22:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。You are different.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.57,1:22:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Different？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.91,1:22:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you not？You protect.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.35,1:22:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.05,1:22:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,You pushed me down out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.99,1:22:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You see the Fountain？- No，but we are close.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.03,1:22:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bring the creature。Cover its head.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.03,1:23:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,She has a name！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.53,1:23:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pray tell.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.27,1:23:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,She is Syrena.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.12,1:23:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ponce de Leon.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.32,1:24:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,If 40 pirates dreamt 40 nights of treasure，
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.19,1:24:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,it would not match the contents of this room.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.90,1:24:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.23,1:24:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You。- No…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.20,1:24:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …you。- I was here first.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.61,1:24:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You，why are you here？- Blackbeard sent me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.78,1:24:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why are you？- Silver chalices
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.41,1:24:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- for my royal liege。- Oh，please.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.02,1:24:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Back，back！We have to balance it out！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.79,1:24:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,The whole ship will slide！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.16,1:24:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right，then.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.93,1:24:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,What if we each choose an item of approximately equal weight？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.51,1:24:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put it back！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.47,1:24:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,We touch nothing！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.45,1:25:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about that？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.59,1:25:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,The chalices.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.66,1:25:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oi！Why do you get to look first？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.33,1:25:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fine，then.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.28,1:25:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Together。- Together.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.55,1:25:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rocks.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.65,1:25:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Spanish.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.72,1:25:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're ahead of us，mate.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.32,1:25:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I shall have a look at that map。If it's what I fear…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.67,1:25:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wonder why they left this behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.88,1:26:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't touch the map.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.02,1:26:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,They know the path，
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.25,1:26:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I can also see where they'll most likely make camp.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.60,1:26:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jack！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.11,1:26:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gibbs，I was just on me way to break you out of jail.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.21,1:26:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,You stole my map.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.28,1:26:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。Best be started.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.79,1:26:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ol？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.71,1:27:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mermaids.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.04,1:27:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Careful，these pools run deep.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.11,1:27:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,If she escapes，all is lost。Quartermaster.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.32,1:27:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look。Look！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.19,1:27:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Staked out to die，to dry in the sun.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.29,1:27:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only half in the water。Not enough to live，
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.06,1:27:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,but just enough to make the dying slow.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.44,1:27:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Think on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.60,1:27:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your people，murdered，harvested for their tears.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.14,1:27:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Syrena，won't you cry？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.35,1:27:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,All die，even you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.32,1:27:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Soon，I hear。- Listen…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.82,1:27:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.82,1:27:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you not hear your sisters scream？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.29,1:28:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you not hear them？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.76,1:28:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,We need but one tear.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.44,1:28:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Vile creature！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.87,1:28:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Chop off her fingers，one by one！- Choke her！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.57,1:28:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cut out the tears from behind the eyes！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.34,1:28:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's your voice in this？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.54,1:28:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe she'll have a change of heart when the sun rises.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.71,1:28:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，aye，she will burn，but I cannot wait for the sun.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.78,1:28:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perhaps we should build a fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.59,1:28:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No。- Do not contest me，cleric.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.89,1:28:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You will not torture her。- We need only one tear.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.13,1:28:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will tear every scale from her body one by one if I see fit.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.40,1:28:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,If that displeases you，go pray.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.13,1:28:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was wrong。Not every soul can be saved。Yours cannot.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.37,1:28:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Behold，gentlemen，a man formerly of faith.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.37,1:28:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,That vile creature，as you call her，is worth a hundred of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.41,1:28:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，you care for her？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.18,1:28:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You fancy her.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.88,1:28:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,And do not deny what is clear to my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.42,1:28:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Question is…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.72,1:29:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,…does she fancy you？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.96,1:29:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,By God，she does。We are in luck！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.97,1:29:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bring forth a tear…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.37,1:29:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,…or witness the death of this poor soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.04,1:29:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Syrena，if you could manage a tear，
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.61,1:29:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I would be grateful.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.55,1:29:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sadness，yes，
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.28,1:29:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- but no sorrow… yet。- Not by your hand，Father！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.85,1:29:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Time and tide wait for none。Quartermaster.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.80,1:29:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye，mermaids are tough.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.44,1:29:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,The lot of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.61,1:29:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tie her up like the others。And get rid of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.58,1:30:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You are confident？- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.69,1:30:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am a woman。So is she.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.70,1:30:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's your play，Jack？Throwing in with Barbossa.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.80,1:30:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,There is a girl…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.70,1:30:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,…a female… of the opposite sex.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.04,1:30:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- When is there not？- Perhaps I should say 「damsel.」
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.14,1:30:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're rescuing a damsel？Well，there's a first.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.31,1:30:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，but it's just that I may have caused said damsel
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.68,1:30:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- some manner of harm many moons ago。- Out with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.39,1:30:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gibbs，this is the woman from Seville.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.86,1:30:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，you pretended to love her，then you left her and broke her heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.93,1:30:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Worse。I may have had，briefly，mind you…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.80,1:30:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …stirrings。- Stirrings？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.07,1:31:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Stirrings。- What？Like feelings，you mean？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.21,1:31:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no。Not quite all the way to feelings。More like…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.35,1:31:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，feelings，damn you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.09,1:31:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you left her still。That's low.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.22,1:31:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.37,1:31:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stealth over force.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.97,1:31:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll take it from here on account of your condition.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.84,1:31:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't have termites，do you？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.84,1:31:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I appreciate your concern，Jack，
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.98,1:31:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I'll be keeping you company all the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.65,1:31:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold here，Lieutenant Commander。Wait for my signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.68,1:32:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,There。That one。That be the leader.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.92,1:32:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Make note of his tent because that's where…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.89,1:32:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，wait。By God，that must be them right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.63,1:32:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your sword smells funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.03,1:32:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye。Poison from the innards of poisonous toads.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.07,1:32:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just a scratch，you're a dead man in minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.31,1:32:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Would you mind pointing it the other way？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.78,1:32:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't like toads.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.41,1:32:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What are you doing？- Planning an escape route.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.99,1:32:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Isn't that how you do it？- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.19,1:32:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or sometimes I just… improvise.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.32,1:33:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now what？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.69,1:33:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,We stroll out，slow and steady.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.36,1:33:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just like we belong.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.62,1:34:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm sorry，Syrena。- Philip，you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.02,1:34:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes。- You came for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.06,1:34:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.70,1:34:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're different，are you not？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.20,1:34:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you know not of kindness？Compassion？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.76,1:35:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tears of sorrow，never.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.89,1:35:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mermaids be too tough for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.46,1:35:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,But tears of joy…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.13,1:35:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,They say these be the more potent anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.67,1:35:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Syrena，on my word，I had no part in this.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.94,1:35:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let her go。You don't need her now.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.54,1:35:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let her go？No.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.61,1:35:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Secure her bonds。We leave her with her own.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.16,1:35:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,How's that escape route working？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.29,1:35:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here's your chance to improvise.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.36,1:35:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm attempting it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.83,1:35:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I might be able to get a hand loose.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.80,1:35:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，you got a knife。That's very good.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.17,1:35:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Better.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.14,1:36:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want one of those.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.12,1:36:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here's to revenge。Sweet and clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.49,1:36:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Revenge？- Come，come，Hector.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.06,1:36:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you wanted the chalices，
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.63,1:36:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,you'd seen they were missing and gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.46,1:36:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were lying in wait，for Blackbeard.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.60,1:36:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,King George。Privateer。Wig.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.97,1:36:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cheap theatrical facade.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.54,1:36:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm not buying it。- You weren't there that night.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.54,1:36:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- When the Pearl was lost？- Taken，not lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.98,1:36:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,We were off the coast of Hispaniola when we came under attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.29,1:36:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,No provocation nor warning nor offer of parley.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.86,1:36:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,We were peppered with cannon fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.66,1:36:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then the sea beneath the Pearl began to roil.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.43,1:37:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Pearl was pitching and yawing violently.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.00,1:37:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Every plank，every rail，
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.01,1:37:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,every spar，all at once，began to creak.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.01,1:37:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,The rigging had come to life.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.18,1:37:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our own ship turned against us…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.01,1:37:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,…tangling the crew，wrapping around 'em like snakes.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.42,1:37:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,And wrapping around me leg.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.99,1:37:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,But me arms were free and me sword was to hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.52,1:37:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am the master of me ship，not Blackbeard.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.19,1:37:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am the master of my fate，not Blackbeard.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.70,1:37:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,So I did what needed done.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.91,1:37:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I survived.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.41,1:37:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,So… you're not after the Fountain.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.75,1:37:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I care not for King George or tavern yarns
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.55,1:37:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,that give hope for a healed limb.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.42,1:38:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I'd give my left arm for a chance at Blackbeard.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.29,1:38:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Not your right？- I need me good arm
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.40,1:38:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,to drive my poisoned blade through his heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.04,1:38:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll see you get the chance，mate.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.22,1:39:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,The prisoner's escaping.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.82,1:39:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's escaping！Fan out！Find him！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.66,1:39:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！Go！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.83,1:39:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold your fire！I want him alive！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.91,1:39:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I figured that was the signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.95,1:40:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Go！Prepare to move out！- The enemy is soon upon us.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.19,1:40:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about the chalices，Jack，but I've an appointment to keep.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.26,1:40:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'll not be going back。- No need.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.40,1:40:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Shall we have a drink？- We'll drink at the Fountain.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.79,1:41:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,How is it we can never meet without you pointing something at me？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.56,1:41:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,You brought the chalices，Sparrow？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.59,1:41:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye。Oi！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.67,1:41:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I see you brought a friend。- I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.94,1:41:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,And the one-legged man，he is near。Aye？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.31,1:41:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.51,1:41:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.68,1:41:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Before I go just handing them over，I do have one or two conditions.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.65,1:41:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Name them。- Firstly，
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.85,1:41:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll be having me compass back。No，no，that's secondly.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.35,1:41:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Firstly，upon your word，
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.72,1:41:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,you will bring no harm to Angelica.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.85,1:41:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll make no vows to the likes of you，Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.36,1:41:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,But it costs me nothing to admit
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.96,1:41:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,that she was never in harm's way.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.46,1:41:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Secondly then，priorly firstly，
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.80,1:42:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will be having me compass back.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.34,1:42:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please？I do deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.50,1:42:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea how difficult it was to catch that filthy pig？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.14,1:42:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not the big one，the four-legged one.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.95,1:42:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you。And thirdly，Mr。Beard，
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.85,1:42:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,there are times，not very often，
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.69,1:42:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,when I do reflect upon my heinous misdeeds.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.96,1:42:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chief among them，I note how poorly I have treated Mr。Gibbs，
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.36,1:42:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- my loyal first mate。- Aye！Now you bring it up…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.16,1:42:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Left him to rot in jail，I did。Didn't care.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.00,1:42:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Still don't。But，point being，you must let him go free.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.51,1:42:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Is that it？- I think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.01,1:42:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quick，or the pig runs，and good luck getting those chalices.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.75,1:42:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jack，if it's all the same to you，I'd be just as…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.35,1:42:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Done.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.78,1:42:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Release the swine.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.79,1:43:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perhaps，if you don't mind，I could tag along with you folk for a…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.80,1:43:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,This will lead you to freedom，mate.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.74,1:43:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I could have swore it was somewhere right around here.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.70,1:44:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,We must not stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.38,1:45:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dead end.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.82,1:45:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dead。End.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.46,1:45:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dead end.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.89,1:45:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jack，I'm starting to think you don't know where you're going.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.66,1:45:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is not the destination so much as the journey，they say.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.70,1:45:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chalices，if you please.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.18,1:45:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stand back.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.07,1:45:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jack…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.77,1:46:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,…have you ever，in fact…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.84,1:46:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,…seen with your own eyes… the Fountain of Youth？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.51,1:46:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，could you repeat the question，please？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.85,1:46:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quartermaster.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.25,1:46:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.89,1:46:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，wait！Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.29,1:46:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Aqua… de Vida.」
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.10,1:47:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Master Scrum…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.77,1:47:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …do you mind？- Squire？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.33,1:48:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,So beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.81,1:48:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sparrow，I'll be the first to taste those waters.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.92,1:48:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.79,1:49:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,The one-legged man.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.63,1:49:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You brought him here。- Would I do that？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.73,1:49:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Edward Teach！
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.97,1:49:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,For crimes committed on the high seas，
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.40,1:49:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,by the authority granted me by His Majesty the King…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.41,1:49:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and with a goodly amount of personal satisfaction…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.74,1:49:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,…I hereby place you in the custody of the court，
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.95,1:49:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,and declare you to be my prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.32,1:49:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,My trick's out，is that it？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.99,1:49:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Such crimes do include，but are not limited to，piracy，treason，
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.53,1:49:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,murder，torture of the most heinous sort，
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.83,1:49:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,including the brutal theft of one used，twisted，hairy right leg.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.54,1:49:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,You… dare face this sword？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.41,1:49:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,This far away from your ship？Aye.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.98,1:50:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye。That be the cold breath of fate I feel down my nape.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.85,1:50:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I'll have one last fight，by God.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.65,1:50:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kill 'em all！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.02,1:50:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hang on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.96,1:50:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just… I just need to understand something.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.00,1:50:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right，so，you will fight against them，
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.50,1:50:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,they will fight against you.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.97,1:50:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,All on account of him wanting to kill him？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.80,1:50:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is the sense？Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.88,1:50:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I say，let them fight each other while we lay back，
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.78,1:50:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,watch，have a drink，place some wagers！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.32,1:50:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.19,1:50:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Kill 'em！- No quarter！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.29,1:51:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get off me！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.92,1:51:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scrum，the chalices！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.09,1:51:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,And the tear！Follow！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.23,1:51:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fight！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.33,1:52:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hand it over。The tear。There's a good lad.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.00,1:52:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm more afraid of her than I am of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.88,1:52:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hand it over。There's a good lad.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.65,1:52:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The chalices，if you please。- Sorry，Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.55,1:52:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you，I need years。And now，yours will do.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.70,1:52:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scrum！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.59,1:52:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Syrena…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.79,1:53:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh God，you will not take her.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.70,1:53:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you have taken her，you will give her back.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.80,1:53:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give her back…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.30,1:53:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give her back，please。Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.76,1:53:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I expected fate to put up more of a fight，eh？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:57.38,1:54:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will not have that smile on your face as I strike you down.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:02.59,1:54:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take a gander，Edward Teach.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:36.22,1:54:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,This land is hereby forever claimed in the glorious name
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.69,1:54:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,of His Majesty King George…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.50,1:54:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone make a note of that man's bravery.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.41,1:55:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sedrita，the chalices，por favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.83,1:55:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only God can grant eternal life，not this pagan water.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.55,1:55:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Men，destroy this profane temple！
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.79,1:55:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Fountain！
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.17,1:55:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are a fool.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:58.84,1:56:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,You seek in this place what only faith can provide.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.24,1:56:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Faith？In faith，there is light enough to see
Dialogue: 0,1:56:04.91,1:56:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,but darkness enough to blind.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:10.78,1:56:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,What devilry is this？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:17.02,1:56:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- For the Pearl。- What have you done？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:23.16,1:56:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Angelica！Don't！It's poison！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:30.20,1:56:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not such the fool to take on Blackbeard
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.67,1:56:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,without a little venomous advantage.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:37.38,1:56:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jack！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.69,1:56:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,I claim Blackbeard's ship and crew，
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.89,1:56:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,and this sword，payment for my missing limb！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.74,1:57:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hang on！Pull！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:57.42,1:57:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do not waste my tear.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.25,1:58:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drink this。This one has the tear.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:31.52,1:58:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You must drink the other。- No！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:34.29,1:58:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I cannot save you both。One of you must sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.46,1:58:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,You take it，Father，for your soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:43.60,1:58:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Captain Teach，she's dying。You must save your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.21,1:58:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,This one takes life？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.14,1:58:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,This one has the tear and gives life？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:55.15,1:58:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye，hurry！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:05.32,1:59:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Angelica… Save me，my child.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:11.50,1:59:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.64,1:59:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love you，Father.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.05,1:59:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:39.86,1:59:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,In fact，it might have been the other way around.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:43.53,1:59:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,This cup had the tear，that one had the other bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:47.47,1:59:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Trickster！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.87,1:59:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Devil！- Father！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:57.74,1:59:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,You bastard！How could you？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.28,2:00:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your father saved you.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.88,2:00:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perhaps his soul is now redeemed，eh？
Dialogue: 0,2:01:05.21,2:01:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are hurt.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.55,2:01:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,In body only.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:13.15,2:01:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,My mind is at peace… because of you.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:18.46,2:01:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Me？- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:22.33,2:01:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was lost.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:25.70,2:01:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,The wind，the tides…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:30.50,2:01:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,…they ought to renew a man's faith.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:35.14,2:01:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,But for me，only you.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:37.98,2:01:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Philip，I can save you.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:41.85,2:01:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,You need only ask.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:46.25,2:01:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I seek but one thing。- What is that？
Dialogue: 0,2:01:52.06,2:01:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:54.56,2:01:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,If not for me，you would never have been captured.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:58.03,2:01:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ask.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:01.57,2:02:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forgive me？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.53,2:02:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.89,2:02:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,The bloke who saved your life？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.36,2:02:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,The years I possess，stolen from my own father！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:35.70,2:02:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,I only helped Blackbeard do what any father should have done.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:38.87,2:02:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are cruel and ignorant.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:45.78,2:02:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,One pistol，one shot.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.71,2:02:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,To kill myself before I starve？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:52.08,2:02:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no trusting you，love.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.79,2:02:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Besides，this is a well-traveled trade route.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.39,2:02:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can signal a passing ship.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:58.12,2:03:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or you can just bite the proverbial bullet，as it were.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:01.73,2:03:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,And how will I get free of these bonds？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:03.46,2:03:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,You broke free of your bonds half an hour ago，
Dialogue: 0,2:03:06.33,2:03:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,waiting for the precise moment to pounce.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:11.87,2:03:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Admit it，Jack.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:13.67,2:03:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You still love me。- If you had a sister and a dog，
Dialogue: 0,2:03:17.74,2:03:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd choose the dog.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:20.21,2:03:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Treasure！There is a chest with jewels！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:23.68,2:03:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jewels with the power to rule the wind and tide！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:26.08,2:03:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're making that up！- Wait…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.99,2:03:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am with child。Yours.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:34.93,2:03:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't recall that we ever had…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:36.46,2:03:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You were drunk！- I've actually never been that drunk.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:39.33,2:03:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:42.33,2:03:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,There is something I want to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:44.57,2:03:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Something I wanted to say from the moment we first met.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:49.67,2:03:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go on，then.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:53.14,2:03:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:58.05,2:03:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,As do I.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:00.02,2:04:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Always have。Always will.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:07.99,2:04:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:09.63,2:04:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jack！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:12.96,2:04:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is not over！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:15.63,2:04:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jack！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:26.28,2:04:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Missed！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:43.06,2:04:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Revenge is mine.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:52.77,2:04:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir…
Dialogue: 0,2:04:56.71,2:04:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,We found this below decks.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:24.67,2:05:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,All hands！Ply to windward！
Dialogue: 0,2:05:27.07,2:05:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get cracking，ye blooming cockroaches！
Dialogue: 0,2:05:33.34,2:05:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Crown served me well.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:36.08,2:05:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,But now，by the gods of sea and sky…
Dialogue: 0,2:05:39.22,2:05:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,…make way for Tortuga！
Dialogue: 0,2:05:54.43,2:05:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gibbs，you filthy，besotted shellback，you made it！
Dialogue: 0,2:05:57.74,2:05:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye！
Dialogue: 0,2:05:59.44,2:06:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I trust we managed a profit
Dialogue: 0,2:06:01.17,2:06:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- from our joint enterprise？- Feast your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:10.41,2:06:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,The compass led me straight and true.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:13.08,2:06:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,What of Blackbeard's men guarding the ship？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:15.19,2:06:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I employed the selfsame maneuver we perfected in New Guinea.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:19.19,2:06:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seemed a shame to leave an entire fleet behind.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:23.43,2:06:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shame indeed.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:37.44,2:06:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hate that monkey.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:38.94,2:06:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，the Pearl… Any idea how to get her out？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:42.51,2:06:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,We shall need a crossbow，an hourglass，three goats.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:45.68,2:06:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,One of us must learn to play the trumpet whilst the other one goes like this…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:49.22,2:06:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I know a man with a goat。- Good。I can go like this.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:55.16,2:06:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jack，I have to ask…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:56.96,2:06:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,You had the chalices，the water，the tear…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:59.96,2:07:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,You could have lived maybe forever.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:02.63,2:07:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Fountain does test you，Gibbs.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:04.77,2:07:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,But better to not know which moment may be your last.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:07.81,2:07:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Every morsel of your entire being
Dialogue: 0,2:07:09.97,2:07:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,alive to the infinite mystery of it all.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:13.21,2:07:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,And who's to say I won't live forever，eh？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:15.88,2:07:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Discoverer of the Fountain of Youth.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:19.15,2:07:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have no say in it，Gibbs.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:22.19,2:07:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a pirate's life for me.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:25.12,2:07:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Savvy？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.52,0:01:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长！船长！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.69,0:01:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.22,0:02:03.07,Note,0,0,0,0,,（西班牙 加的斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.45,0:02:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.78,0:02:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下 他是我们用渔网网到的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.45,0:02:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下 他一直在胡言乱语 他说…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.52,0:02:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们觉得他找到了…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.43,0:02:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡安·庞塞·德莱昂：西班牙人 1513年为寻找不老泉发现佛罗里达 庞赛·德莱昂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.54,0:02:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他发现了庞赛·德莱昂的船
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.97,0:02:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还搭过那艘船 - 不可能 我跟你说过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.84,0:03:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,庞赛·德莱昂200年前就死了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.24,0:03:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 但他是为了找一样东西才死的 不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.48,0:03:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不老泉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.32,0:03:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你船能开多快？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.39,0:03:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,与浪涛齐驱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.44,0:03:30.44,Title,0,0,0,0,,《加勒比海盗4：惊涛怪浪》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.67,0:03:37.52,Note,0,0,0,0,,（英格兰 伦敦）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.58,0:03:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,卖幸运花嘞！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.01,0:03:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,处决海盗！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.15,0:03:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,今日处决海盗 来看他被吊死吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.69,0:03:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,海盗人偶！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.19,0:03:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,接招吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.36,0:03:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 爸爸 不然就看不到绞刑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.29,0:03:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还没到绞刑 宝贝 只是审讯 绞刑得等下午
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.16,0:03:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天吊死海盗！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.73,0:04:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 起来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.74,0:04:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,往前走 海盗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.24,0:04:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者叫“海盗船长”？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.24,0:04:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点快点！上台阶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.58,0:04:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,肃静！保持秩序！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.92,0:04:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,肃静！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.12,0:04:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在站在法庭上的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.05,0:04:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是声名狼藉、恶名昭著的海盗、强盗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.42,0:04:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抢劫犯… - 肃静！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.96,0:04:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克·斯派罗船长！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.90,0:04:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过 我叫吉布斯！杰什米·吉布斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.57,0:04:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说了多少次了… - 听好 听好！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.54,0:04:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,主持这次审讯的是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.97,0:04:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位请起立 欢迎尊敬的史密斯法官！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.25,0:04:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,阁下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.33,0:05:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,肃静！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.70,0:05:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.10,0:05:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,…这是谁呀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.24,0:05:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.67,0:05:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.01,0:05:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没见过他啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.11,0:05:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用打他 你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.44,0:05:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不叫杰克·斯派罗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.25,0:05:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫杰什米·吉布斯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.28,0:05:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.15,0:05:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里写着杰克·斯派罗 - 我跟他们说了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.32,0:05:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是杰克·斯派罗 如果能减轻我罪行的的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.62,0:05:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我倒很乐意在庭上指认他 - 我看你还是别这样辩护
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.66,0:05:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你还想挨棍子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.06,0:05:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,被告声称自己
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.80,0:05:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是杰克·斯派罗 你们怎么看？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.04,0:05:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不审讯吗？可我们还要检查证据…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.20,0:05:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,陪审团主席 你的判决是？有罪？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.87,0:05:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有罪意味着他要受绞刑？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.48,0:05:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,绞死他！把他吊死！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.35,0:05:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那就有罪 - 这不公平！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:05:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.09,0:06:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰什米·吉布斯 你被判的罪行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.96,0:06:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是“不是杰克·斯派罗”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.43,0:06:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在此从轻处理
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.36,0:06:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,判你无期徒刑 在监狱里度过
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.17,0:06:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,悲惨无助的余生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.17,0:06:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？！ - 绞死他！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.24,0:06:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 绞死他！ - 退庭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.17,0:06:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一派胡言！ - 吊死他！绞死他！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.58,0:06:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,立即准备把犯人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.38,0:06:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,押到伦敦塔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.79,0:06:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.60,0:06:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.60,0:06:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 上去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.61,0:06:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,上去！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.05,0:07:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 现在我俩都要坐牢了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.82,0:07:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 我买通了车夫
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.69,0:07:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要十分钟 我们就能出伦敦 马都备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.16,0:07:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚就能到海边
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.83,0:07:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后找艘船就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.46,0:07:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一切都在计划之中 是吧？ - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.27,0:07:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,今早我到伦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.37,0:07:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,来救要上绞刑架的杰什米·吉布斯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.64,0:07:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你还生龙活虎的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.57,0:07:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以说目前我的计划相当成功
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.98,0:07:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出了什么事 吉布斯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.31,0:07:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你上别处干活 或是改行了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.05,0:07:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是 但我一直偷偷打听黑珍珠号的消息
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.65,0:07:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人知道它会在哪儿靠岸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.25,0:07:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来我听说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.46,0:07:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克·斯派罗有艘船 正在伦敦招船员
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.09,0:07:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没有 - 但我就是这么听说的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.96,0:07:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,传闻说 你今晚要签订船员
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.33,0:07:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在船长千金酒馆
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.00,0:07:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没有！ - 我也觉得有点怪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.40,0:07:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你从不按套路出牌
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.97,0:08:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.41,0:08:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,会不会是有人盗用我杰克·斯派罗的大名？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.08,0:08:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 冒充你 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.35,0:08:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是…这个冒充者有船
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.22,0:08:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,还需要船员
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.96,0:08:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是巧了 我也需要
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.99,0:08:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样 杰克？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.76,0:08:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前我听说你发誓要找到不老泉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.76,0:08:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,有眉目了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.33,0:08:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,形势所迫 我不得不把握好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.44,0:08:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,何时该谨慎 何时该英勇
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.54,0:08:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 意思是你放弃了 - 我没有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.81,0:08:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是一样坚定 丝毫没变
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.78,0:08:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会喝到那泉水 吉布斯先生 记住我的话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.35,0:08:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么快啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.26,0:08:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都在计划中 是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.50,0:09:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.89,0:10:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是杰克·斯派罗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.50,0:10:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该加上“船长”
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.93,0:10:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说过你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.60,0:10:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道我是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.67,0:10:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有点面熟 我惹过你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.37,0:10:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你面前的是布伦瑞克-吕内堡公爵 乔治·奥古斯塔斯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.31,0:10:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,神圣罗马帝国的财务大臣和选帝侯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.31,0:10:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,大不列颠及爱尔兰联合王国国王 你的国王
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.18,0:10:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没想起来 - 我得知
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.69,0:11:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来伦敦是为了招募船员
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.96,0:11:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,诽谤 没这回事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.59,0:11:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是你谎称自己是杰克·斯派罗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.83,0:11:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是杰克·斯派罗 但我来这不是为了招船员
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.20,0:11:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,招船员的…另有其人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.80,0:11:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克·斯派罗另有其人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.04,0:11:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们抓错人了 这人没用
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.38,0:11:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到对的 把这个冒牌货解决掉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.81,0:11:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 等等 等会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.02,0:11:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是杰克·斯派罗 货真价实 只此一个
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.55,0:11:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确实在伦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.39,0:11:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,招募船员
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.62,0:11:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备启程
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.43,0:11:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 寻找不老泉… - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.03,0:11:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能把这可恶的手铐拿走？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.73,0:11:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点快点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.37,0:11:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道你有份地图
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.90,0:11:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,地图没收 送他上绞架！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.21,0:11:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有地图吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.48,0:12:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 地图在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.58,0:12:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,想听实话吗？我弄丢了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.42,0:12:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就在刚才 - 我得到情报
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,西班牙人已经获知不老泉的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.33,0:12:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不能让那个多愁善感的西班牙国王
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.57,0:12:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个天主教徒 长生不老！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.27,0:12:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道怎么去不老泉吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.81,0:12:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.11,0:12:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以率领远征队
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.08,0:12:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要陛下您同意
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.79,0:12:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我 呃 一艘船…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.09,0:12:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,…和船员
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.59,0:12:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有船长
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.24,0:13:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,午安 陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.48,0:13:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我直言 为什么没把那个人拷起来？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.48,0:13:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须立刻把他拷上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.52,0:13:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的皇宫中？他跑不了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.29,0:13:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫克托
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.59,0:13:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高兴能看到海盗朋友改邪归正
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.20,0:13:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,海盗？不 我是私掠船船长
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.50,0:13:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在执行由王室授权的任务 并受王室保护
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.20,0:13:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是吧 但是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.84,0:13:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我心爱的黑珍珠怎么样了？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.18,0:13:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把黑珍珠弄丢了 我的腿也没了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.45,0:13:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 黑珍珠丢了？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.85,0:13:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我奋力保护她 但她还是沉了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.43,0:13:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果船真的沉了 你该跟她一起沉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.03,0:14:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴博萨船长 我们每拖延一秒钟 西班牙人就领先一步
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.47,0:14:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有绝对的信心 你定能战胜他们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.04,0:14:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,获得你渴望的崇高地位
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.51,0:14:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为您不遗余力 陛下 - 船长 你堕落了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.38,0:14:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 我们时间不多了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.88,0:14:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,何不加入赢家的队伍？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.35,0:14:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能结识王公贵族
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.26,0:14:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.03,0:14:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了你那顶假发
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.80,0:14:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要逃跑！拦下他！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.01,0:14:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拦住他！ - 拦住那个海盗！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.56,0:15:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.84,0:15:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他跑了？ - 交给我 陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.75,0:15:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,守卫！守卫！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.94,0:15:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备武器！ - 遵命 先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.32,0:16:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.81,0:16:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁捡归谁！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.71,0:16:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.47,0:16:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就完了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.14,0:16:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车！拦住那辆马车！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.61,0:16:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,拦下他！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.89,0:17:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,别挡路！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.35,0:17:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,拦住那个海盗！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.69,0:17:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,快让开！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.00,0:17:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,拦住那个人！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.67,0:17:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他逃了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.81,0:18:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.90,0:18:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他逃走了！跟上！拦住他！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.84,0:18:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟上！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.16,0:18:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,肮脏的海盗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.34,0:19:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 小杰
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.31,0:19:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.82,0:19:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你正在招募船员
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.62,0:19:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,人人都这么说的话 那一定是真的了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.62,0:19:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你要去不老泉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.53,0:19:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去过吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.96,0:19:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这老脸像是去过不老泉的样子么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.63,0:19:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这儿光线不好 - 儿子 去不老泉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.97,0:19:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须准备几件异教仪式的物品
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.91,0:19:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,两只圣杯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.34,0:19:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 地图上是一只 - 两只 银制的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.88,0:19:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,在庞赛·德莱昂的船上 两只都要
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.88,0:19:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 用来干嘛？ - 进行仪式 别犯傻 小杰
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.65,0:19:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,起航前要确定每个细节
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.86,0:19:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒是想起航
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.86,0:19:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还需要一艘船
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.23,0:20:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边那些家伙 他们有船
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.66,0:20:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正在签订水手
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.37,0:20:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 爱神之箭射中我心 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.70,0:20:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 金银财宝算什么 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.84,0:20:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一件事 小杰
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.54,0:20:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不老泉会考验你的 记住我的话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.04,0:20:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 爱神之箭射中我心 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.51,0:20:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 金银财宝算什么 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.58,0:20:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 唯有你能给我慰藉 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.48,0:20:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 勇敢快乐的水手 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.20,0:20:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说你们在招募船员
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.57,0:20:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.77,0:20:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克·斯派罗正在招募优秀船员出海
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.31,0:20:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你胆子也太大了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.78,0:20:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然穿成这样来这儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.45,0:20:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么东西 冒牌货？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.58,0:20:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是谁你还看不出来吗 兄弟？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.19,0:21:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计们！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.72,0:21:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有个家伙把自己名字都忘了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.13,0:21:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 斯派罗签下我了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.53,0:21:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起喝两杯吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.90,0:21:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一位！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.34,0:21:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来几瓶酒！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.58,0:21:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 要四瓶！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.26,0:21:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你冒充我 我要揭穿你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.80,0:22:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.42,0:23:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道这步法的只有一个还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.93,0:24:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,早就想这么做了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.10,0:24:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久不见 安吉莉卡
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.11,0:24:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久不见 杰克 意外吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.14,0:24:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才有几次我差点就杀死你了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.48,0:24:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的甜言蜜语真让我感动
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.99,0:24:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么冒充我？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.39,0:24:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会假扮的海盗也就你了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.16,0:24:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不算是称赞
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.33,0:24:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 杰克 我很久之前就原谅你了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.13,0:24:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 原谅什么？原谅我甩了你？ - 是我甩了你
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.44,0:24:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让你继续幻想吧 谁叫我是绅士呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.48,0:24:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 斯派罗 只要能拿到钱
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.15,0:24:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,水手就愿意忍受任何怪事
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.32,0:24:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,有件怪事我就不能忍受
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.65,0:24:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要当“船长” 货真价实的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.86,0:24:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你得有船才行
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.03,0:25:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 有船的是我
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.46,0:25:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以用你这艘
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.53,0:25:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你去过不老泉
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.43,0:25:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些天谣言满天飞
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.70,0:25:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就说不老泉 - 亲爱的安吉莉卡 别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.37,0:25:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还得好几年才用得上不老泉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.48,0:25:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是这么会说话
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.78,0:25:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没回答我
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.02,0:25:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 不老泉啊 别白费力气了…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.72,0:25:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 有些家伙来找麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.49,0:25:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的海盗！找到他们！这群臭虫！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.36,0:25:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.66,0:25:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像不小心得罪了个国王之类的人
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.47,0:25:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.37,0:25:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真是一点没变 - 你希望我变？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.17,0:25:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.67,0:25:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以国王的名义命令你把门打开
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.51,0:25:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你背弃了我 你勾引我然后利用我
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.01,0:25:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时我还是个不谙情事的小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.88,0:25:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还真是带坏了一个很有技巧的小姑娘啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.28,0:25:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,火烧眉毛了！这边 小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.22,0:26:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.99,0:26:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都要发永愿成为修女了 都是你…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.69,0:26:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 你当时去西班牙修道院干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.49,0:26:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞错了 以为那是妓院 真是失误啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.17,0:26:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在这儿！ - 那边！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.22,0:26:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况不妙
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.29,0:26:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你 我可不像某人
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.86,0:26:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,还以为自己装得挺像
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.76,0:26:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才是杰克·斯派罗船长
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.43,0:27:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能说我利用了你？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.14,0:27:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.47,0:27:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 但你怎么能说出口呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.25,0:27:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那到底是怎么回事？ - 什么怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.92,0:27:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不老泉的事
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.02,0:27:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都知道些什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.02,0:27:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该不会是恰巧有
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.73,0:27:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,庞赛·德莱昂的两只银杯吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.70,0:27:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 我想也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.70,0:27:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 我听到一些说法
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.47,0:27:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是谣言
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.40,0:27:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定知道那个仪式
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.54,0:28:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.98,0:28:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么仪式？需要什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.32,0:28:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一条美人鱼 杰克
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.29,0:28:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们搞错了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.83,0:28:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被判无期 不是死刑 不用死啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.77,0:28:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 巴博萨 - 谢谢诸位先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.24,0:28:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会绑绞索吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.38,0:28:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,太不厚道了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.91,0:28:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然叫我自己绑绳子吊死自己
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.75,0:28:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要为你的行为付出代价
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.42,0:28:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.92,0:28:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克·斯派罗在哪儿？ - 他逃了？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.46,0:28:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我时间很紧 吉布斯
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.06,0:28:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇家神谕号天亮就启航了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.56,0:28:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不想被吊死在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.87,0:29:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,满嘴都是苍蝇的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.54,0:29:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,…快招
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.91,0:29:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我走吧 去哪都行…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.54,0:29:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,带你去哪儿 吉布斯？不老泉 是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.48,0:29:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是杰克要去的地方吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.68,0:29:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能给我什么好处 吉布斯？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.82,0:29:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,有么？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.16,0:29:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说一不二 你活不到天亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.70,0:29:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.18,0:29:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你个蠢货！ - 我已经仔细地
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.61,0:29:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,研究了这该死的圆圈
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.25,0:29:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的路线 所有的目的地 都牢牢地记在我脑子里
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.39,0:29:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎加入皇家海军 吉布斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.50,0:30:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,起床了 水手！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.64,0:30:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.41,0:30:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.84,0:30:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是个严重的错误 - 继续走
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.55,0:30:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不该在这儿的 - 很多人在船上醒来时
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.65,0:30:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不知道自己怎么会来这鬼地方的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.75,0:30:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不记得头天晚上为什么要签雇佣协定
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.12,0:30:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,还把所有赏钱都买酒喝了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.79,0:30:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 你不懂 兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.89,0:30:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是杰克·斯派罗船长 独此一家 如假包换
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.46,0:30:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是斯克拉姆 幸会幸会 赶紧走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.54,0:30:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯克拉姆
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.14,0:30:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的胳膊放进来
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.88,0:30:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么有个玻璃棺材？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.88,0:30:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看起来像管事的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.48,0:31:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是在哪儿？ - 斯派罗船长先生
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.55,0:31:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常荣幸地欢迎您
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.36,0:31:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,登上臭名昭著的安妮女王复仇号
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.03,0:31:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑胡子：本名爱德华·蒂奇 世界航海史上最臭名昭彰的海盗之一 嗜好杀人 黑胡子
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.05,0:31:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,干活！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.72,0:31:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他很古怪 - 他变成僵尸了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.95,0:31:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.73,0:31:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,僵尸
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.39,0:31:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑胡子干的 他的船员都是
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.03,0:31:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样他们更顺从
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.03,0:31:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,脾气还很暴躁呢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.70,0:31:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 擦 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.38,0:32:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉！拉！拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.55,0:32:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,出海至少五天了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.26,0:32:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你从海的气味中判断出来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.23,0:32:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是水手的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.53,0:32:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎 那个倒霉鬼犯的什么事儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.77,0:32:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好引以为戒
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.94,0:32:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他？是个教徒
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.41,0:32:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,老是说万能的主
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.58,0:32:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,船上的传教士？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.45,0:32:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前是
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.48,0:32:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说他是一次突袭时被抓来的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.35,0:32:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,船上其他人都被杀了 就剩他
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.35,0:32:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,大副不愿意杀他
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.82,0:32:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他信主
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.66,0:32:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女大副以自己的性命担保这个犯人
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.23,0:32:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,稀奇吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.96,0:32:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,女大副？大副是个女的？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.80,0:32:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去干活！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.34,0:33:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持平稳
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.83,0:33:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个无情无义、倔强任性的坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.33,0:33:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说了我有船 - 这船是黑胡子的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.97,0:33:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我被困在这了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.94,0:33:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能做到的 杰克
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.04,0:33:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到不老泉 你不是一直想么
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.75,0:33:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑胡子 爱德华·蒂奇 所有海盗都惧怕的海盗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.02,0:33:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,闲着没事还爱弄僵尸
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.32,0:33:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他会听我的 - 他谁也不听
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.32,0:33:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲生女儿也不听？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.76,0:33:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,女儿…他有女儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.56,0:34:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,失散已久 最近才相认的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.54,0:34:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,全心全意地爱着她亲爱的老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.51,0:34:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这他也信？ - 我就这么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.02,0:34:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你找不老泉是为了他
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.98,0:34:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是为了你俩 不是为了我俩
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.99,0:34:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 杰克 最重要的是
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.19,0:34:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会死的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.56,0:34:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会亲手解决他？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.10,0:34:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人预言
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.46,0:34:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能不相信有超自然现象
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.80,0:34:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦不不 我经历过几次
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.87,0:34:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,预言说
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.01,0:34:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑胡子两星期内
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.95,0:34:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会死在一个独脚男人手上
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.55,0:34:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他才要找不老泉 杰克
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.07,0:35:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉布斯先生 我们没有地图
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.97,0:35:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总该给指一个方向吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.85,0:35:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,行行好给我杯酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.08,0:35:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是私掠船船员 可不是海盗 吉布斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.65,0:35:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以国王的名义行事
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.92,0:35:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 船长
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.16,0:35:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,航向对吗 吉布斯？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.10,0:35:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,航向没问题 那就是证据
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.21,0:35:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,西班牙人
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.08,0:35:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体船员！准备作战！抢占上风！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.95,0:35:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备作战 抢占上风！ - 调整双点！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.15,0:36:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 调整双点！ - 装置大炮！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.56,0:36:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 枪炮手就位！ - 枪炮手就位！枪炮手已就位 长官！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.46,0:36:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 向前！装弹！ - 等待命令！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.43,0:36:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.14,0:36:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,炮已装弹 等待命令 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.51,0:36:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 下令吧 长官？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.69,0:36:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们头都没转
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.56,0:36:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到不老泉才是最终胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.56,0:36:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,连击沉我们都是浪费时间
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.33,0:36:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经落后了 全体船员 升起风帆！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.37,0:36:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体船员 升起风帆！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.07,0:36:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,乘风破浪前进吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.38,0:37:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,绅士们 我们要讨论的是 暴动
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.75,0:37:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,最邪恶的 暴动
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.69,0:37:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我签的是杰克·斯派罗的船 可不是什么冒牌货
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.36,0:37:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是个女的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.76,0:37:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没提过船上有可怕的僵尸
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.10,0:37:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,吓得我头皮直发麻
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.60,0:37:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了 所有的都拿来了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.84,0:37:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干得好 - 好兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.91,0:37:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好样的 还有黑胡子
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.51,0:37:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他有什么习惯？ - 一直待在船长室
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.08,0:37:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 一直待在船长室
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.98,0:37:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 但他出来的时候… - 他不怎么出来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.19,0:37:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总会出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.42,0:37:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没见过
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.46,0:37:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人以前跟他出过海吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.29,0:37:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没人 - 我没有
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.89,0:37:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对没有
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.06,0:37:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那有人见过他吗？ - 也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.53,0:37:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直在船长室 没人跟他出海过
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.87,0:37:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人见过他…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.07,0:38:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好消息 先生们 这不是黑胡子的船
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.21,0:38:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是安妮女王复仇号
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.14,0:38:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这绝对是安妮女王复仇号
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.31,0:38:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.91,0:38:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了船名 就在船后舷
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.42,0:38:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,绅士们 先生们 战友们…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.13,0:38:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你们都被骗了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.36,0:38:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们被耍了？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.67,0:38:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不知道目的地
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.70,0:38:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,等待我们的将是死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.01,0:38:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们正驶向不老泉
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.65,0:38:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们处境不妙 兄弟们
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.48,0:38:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 完了 死定了 - 那是阴暗灵魂的花园
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.72,0:38:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们会死在那里 - 除非…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.26,0:38:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我们占领这艘船
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.06,0:38:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就占领这艘船 就现在！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.83,0:39:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.14,0:39:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帮个忙 兄弟们！ - 让他们瞧瞧！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.94,0:39:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快起来！我们占领这了！ - 快！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.31,0:39:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,起床！下来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.51,0:39:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都给我起来！ - 给他们点颜色看看 兄弟们！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.01,0:39:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起打吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.40,0:39:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.43,0:39:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这是梦的话 你就别摘剑脱鞋了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.21,0:39:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果不是… - 这是梦
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.35,0:39:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这不是梦！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.72,0:39:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得好心警告你一声 我们要占领这艘船
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.32,0:39:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是针对你
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.89,0:39:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你最好还是…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.43,0:40:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,…别插手
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.35,0:40:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,真讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.14,0:40:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.17,0:41:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我们还是帮他们？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.31,0:41:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不帮你们 也不帮他们！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.64,0:41:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也行啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.14,0:41:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他信教嘛 要保持中立
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.49,0:41:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就硬挺吧 一群蠢货！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.63,0:41:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他 伙计 把他绑起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.78,0:42:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,船是我们的了！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.35,0:42:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.03,0:42:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被你们搞糊涂了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.63,0:42:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正休息得好好的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.43,0:42:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然就听甲板上一阵喧闹
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.17,0:43:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,水手们未经同意
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.24,0:43:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,擅离职守
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.88,0:43:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,桅杆前的几个人
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.25,0:43:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,把船占为己有
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.39,0:43:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算什么 大副？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.86,0:43:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是暴动 船长 - 再说一遍？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.86,0:43:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 暴动！ - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.40,0:43:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴动
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.60,0:43:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴动者该怎么处置
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.20,0:43:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都知道吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.87,0:43:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴动者罪当吊死！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.26,0:44:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 我要向您报告一起暴动
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.50,0:44:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能把他们都指认出来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.27,0:44:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 斯派罗先生
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.87,0:44:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只是棋子 你才是带头的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.01,0:44:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,您女儿可真漂亮啊 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.35,0:44:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就当作你生前最后的美景吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.95,0:44:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了 父亲 我们需要他
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.48,0:44:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是不隔三差五杀个人
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.09,0:44:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们该忘记我是谁了 - 懦夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.16,0:45:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会忘记的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.49,0:45:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,船员们会记得你是恶棍
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.00,0:45:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个懦夫 不管你杀多少人
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.43,0:45:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我今天第二次被搞糊涂了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.00,0:45:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是糊涂 你是害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.84,0:45:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不敢走正义的光明大道
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.31,0:45:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了 先生 事情远没有你想得那么复杂
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.68,0:45:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就是个大恶人 - 我说的也对
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.71,0:45:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该把你也杀了 传教士
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.85,0:45:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行！ - 倔脾气跟你母亲一样
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.58,0:45:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲 求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.79,0:45:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 我差点忘了船上为什么会有传教士
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.69,0:45:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我女儿担心我残缺不堪的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.10,0:45:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的以为能拯救我么 孩子？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.90,0:45:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个灵魂都能得到救赎
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.90,0:45:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的吗 年轻人？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.90,0:45:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 虽然拯救你难度很大
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.61,0:45:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仍会为这诅咒之船上每一个不幸的灵魂祈祷
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.12,0:45:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的信仰说服了我
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.15,0:46:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,八击钟！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.76,0:46:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个倒霉鬼值班？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.89,0:46:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我 我值班 - 炮手？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.24,0:46:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.30,0:46:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.47,0:46:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.41,0:46:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是厨子
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.51,0:46:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 把大艇降下去！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.65,0:46:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,掉头瞄准！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.20,0:46:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么要这么做？ - 暴乱嘛 得按规矩来
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.40,0:46:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,规矩也允许船长宽宏大量
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.80,0:46:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经给了他掌握自己的命运的机会了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.54,0:46:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是每个人都有这种机会的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.35,0:47:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,该你了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.12,0:47:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,借此机会展示下祈祷的力量吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.86,0:47:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就祈祷他可以摆脱…魔鬼？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.24,0:47:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射锁定！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.77,0:47:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 给他一个机会 也给你自己一个…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.33,0:47:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我何时感觉最接近主吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.07,0:47:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是当我看到苦难、疼痛和绝望之时
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.07,0:47:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才是主创造世界的真正意图
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.74,0:48:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为在苦难和悲剧中
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.58,0:48:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,无助的人会得到仁慈和怜悯
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.01,0:48:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你该祈祷他不会受伤 对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.55,0:48:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求你了 还有希望的… - 再来！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.50,0:48:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我其实对不老泉什么的没兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.20,0:48:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你非要去
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.20,0:48:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就随便找地儿让我下船吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.54,0:48:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,退下吧 舵手
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.31,0:48:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说话云里雾里的 让人看不透
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.94,0:48:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你呢 无所不能的黑胡子？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.92,0:48:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说你被砍了头
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.85,0:48:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,身体还能围着船游三圈 再爬回甲板
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.42,0:48:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你现在 却在仓皇逃命
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.66,0:48:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 逃命 - 逃去不老泉
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.23,0:48:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个舵手能预见未来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.40,0:49:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他预言了我的死亡 泄露了天机
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.00,0:49:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,命运已经注定了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.54,0:49:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也太迷信命运了 伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.61,0:49:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你呢？ - 我？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.34,0:49:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对所有预言都持怀疑态度…包括关于我自己的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.78,0:49:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,和命运作对很愚蠢 但我还是要试着反抗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.69,0:49:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会找到不老泉 你会带我去的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.03,0:49:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那把刀就和你策划暴动一样没用
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.16,0:49:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴动很有用
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.10,0:49:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让我见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.04,0:49:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.67,0:49:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要警告你
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.44,0:49:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的大副
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.14,0:49:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,假装成她说的那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.65,0:49:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,说
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.25,0:49:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是你女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.32,0:49:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你敢质疑我的亲生骨肉？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.52,0:50:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 那女人骗人技术登峰造极
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.20,0:50:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 是我无意中带她走上这条歪路的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.80,0:50:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我没有证据
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.87,0:50:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过她可是个天生的骗子
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.84,0:50:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,安吉莉卡 我心爱的女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.48,0:50:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这辈子里唯一一件好事就是能有她
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.21,0:50:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你说是你把她带坏的？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.02,0:50:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 她纯粹就是个魔鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.19,0:50:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,比野兽还可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.72,0:50:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是那种长着獠牙的饥饿野兽
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.69,0:50:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,穷凶恶极的野兽…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.86,0:50:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 父亲？ - 宝贝！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.97,0:50:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要伤害他 父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.67,0:50:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会帮我们的 对吧 杰克？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.04,0:50:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看吧？她还在帮你说话
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.91,0:50:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使你一直在诬陷她
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.05,0:51:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会带我们去不老泉 是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.36,0:51:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.86,0:51:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不能及时找到不老泉…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.90,0:51:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你也别想
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.04,0:51:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上就看航海图 行了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.91,0:51:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.05,0:51:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯？ - 船长大人
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.55,0:51:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉要向您报告些谣言
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.09,0:51:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是船员们说的 关于目的地
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.46,0:51:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上你的臭嘴 走开
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.46,0:51:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就这样吧 - 无意冒犯 长官
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.90,0:51:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在怕什么？你说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.47,0:51:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,白浪湾
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.94,0:51:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 白浪湾啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.18,0:52:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,窝囊废都怕这个名字
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.41,0:52:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然不知道有什么好怕的 也没人敢问
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.92,0:52:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说是真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.72,0:52:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在担心什么 吉布斯
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.65,0:52:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不说就当你是胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.49,0:52:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,美人鱼 船长
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.26,0:52:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 美人鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.16,0:52:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,海上食人者 邪恶的鱼类 嗜好新鲜的人肉
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.47,0:52:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正是要通过人鱼的海域
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.17,0:52:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的灵魂看紧了 吉布斯
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.87,0:52:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为人鱼会把人吃到…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.68,0:52:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,…只剩骨头
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.65,0:52:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静！冷静！水手们！拿出勇气
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.95,0:52:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,战胜恐惧！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.99,0:52:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是逃吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.96,0:52:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 水手落水了！ - 不！是逃兵落水
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.96,0:52:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 掉头 - 不！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.00,0:52:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 我不会勉强你们做你们办不到的事
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.97,0:52:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要问问你们：我们是不是皇家海军？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.57,0:53:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.17,0:53:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 执行的是不是皇家任务？ - 是
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.11,0:53:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些超过我们的西班牙人 眼里可没有任何恐惧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.48,0:53:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们是不是皇家海军？ - 是！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.35,0:53:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好！全体就位！改变航向！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.45,0:53:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标直指白浪湾！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.02,0:53:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,航向 白浪湾！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.37,0:53:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.01,0:53:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝两杯
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.48,0:53:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,美酒 音乐 烛光
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.85,0:53:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这感觉似曾相识啊 杰克
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.22,0:53:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.02,0:53:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.26,0:53:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,缠绕 扭动 翻转 回旋 翻滚
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.23,0:53:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不停的翻滚
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.70,0:53:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得圣多米尼克吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.00,0:54:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,马提尼克岛
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.70,0:54:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在圣多米尼克我想杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.54,0:54:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你没有
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.11,0:54:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀掉初恋情人实在是不合适
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.27,0:54:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的初恋吗？我常常在想
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.88,0:54:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要的样子是如此迷人 杰克
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.25,0:54:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,关键是你想要什么
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.85,0:54:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,真相？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.66,0:54:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑胡子达到了他的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.29,0:54:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以一起去不老泉
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.76,0:54:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起沐浴 一起享受名誉
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.96,0:54:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,纵情肆意
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.13,0:54:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会告诉你不老泉的仪式
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.27,0:54:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 邪恶的异教仪式
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.81,0:54:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能信任你吗 杰克？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.14,0:54:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我需要你帮我 - 哦 亲爱的安吉莉卡
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.68,0:54:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是一条贼船上的亲密恋人
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.29,0:54:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我规则吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.66,0:55:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不老泉的水
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.16,0:55:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,新鲜的人鱼眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.70,0:55:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,庞赛·德莱昂的银杯
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.97,0:55:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了这些…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.84,0:55:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎样？ - 有了这些
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.11,0:55:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就可以夺走另一个人的寿命 杰克
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.78,0:55:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这意味着什么
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.72,0:55:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能单独去 不能只有你和我
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.79,0:55:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,仪式需要一个祭品
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.79,0:55:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真不幸 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.66,0:55:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现对不老泉越来越没兴趣了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.93,0:55:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这船上有你最想要的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.34,0:55:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑胡子呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.84,0:55:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,在航海图室 我们动作要快
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.52,0:56:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把抢来的每艘船都留作战利品
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.89,0:56:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮我 我就让你挑一艘
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.50,0:56:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也知道你会挑哪艘
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.77,0:56:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑珍珠号在瓶子里？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.41,0:56:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑珍珠号怎么会在瓶子里？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.92,0:56:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这猴子变成模型更招人烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.92,0:56:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说定了 杰克？ - 安吉莉卡 我了解你
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.09,0:56:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会夺走无辜的人的性命的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.53,0:56:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个独腿的人怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.06,0:56:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要寿命 杰克
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.53,0:56:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是为我 是为我父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.57,0:56:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的是黑胡子的女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.91,0:57:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你入戏太深了 亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.25,0:57:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 他真是我父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.68,0:57:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说的谎话其实不是谎话
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.15,0:57:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说真话却骗我是谎话？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.16,0:57:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是 - 真厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.36,0:57:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能用这招吗？ - 你肯定会用的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.93,0:57:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然会
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.43,0:57:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你不会放弃这次冒险的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.73,0:57:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想有个父亲 我从没有过
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.10,0:57:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,安吉莉卡 你父亲 黑胡子…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.94,0:57:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,…他非常邪恶
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.44,0:57:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要的他连你也杀
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.78,0:57:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他不可能得到救赎的 - 你凭什么规定
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.05,0:57:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,救赎的界限？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.38,0:57:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你耽误了我的大好时光 杰克 你欠我的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.82,0:57:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在自寻死路
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.06,0:57:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想袖手旁观
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.49,0:57:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,白浪湾！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.34,0:58:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体船员到甲板上集合！ 准备上大艇！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.81,0:58:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,把网摊平！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.51,0:58:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要缠成一团 要漂漂亮亮地迎接我们美丽的客人
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.45,0:58:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要亮光 很亮的光
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.02,0:58:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.84,0:58:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻到了吗？是鲸鱼油 特别好烧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.22,0:58:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能点起亮吗？ - 英国佬建的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.12,0:58:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望不大
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.23,0:59:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,月牙环抱阴影
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.33,0:59:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏季的第一天
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.47,0:59:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,最适合收集人鱼眼泪了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.95,0:59:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们完了 他们会被灯光引来的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.02,0:59:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鲨鱼么？ - 比那糟多了 孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.86,0:59:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,一小时内人鱼就找到这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.53,0:59:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我们会被吃掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.64,0:59:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说人鱼的吻可以让水手不会淹死
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.44,0:59:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,别傻了！人鱼都是母的 孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.44,0:59:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,美得像天仙一样
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.38,0:59:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是一到吃饭的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.79,0:59:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们会把水手从船里拖出来
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.92,0:59:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,拖下甲板
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.09,1:00:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,先拉到海底淹死 然后吃掉
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.46,1:00:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候是先吃再淹死
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.27,1:00:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 唱歌 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.20,1:00:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们喜欢听人唱歌
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.68,1:00:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我名叫玛利亚 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.41,1:00:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 商人的美丽女儿 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.68,1:00:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大点声 - ∮ 我已离开了父母 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.46,1:00:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 每年能赚3000磅 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.79,1:00:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 爱神之箭射中我心 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.96,1:00:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 金银财宝算什么 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.57,1:00:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 唯有你能给我慰藉 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.17,1:00:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 勇敢快乐的水手 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.81,1:00:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 爱神之箭射中我心 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.94,1:00:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 金银财宝算什么 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.78,1:00:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 唯有你能给我慰藉 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.65,1:01:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 勇敢快乐的水手 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.04,1:01:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.81,1:01:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快看 看那儿
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.15,1:01:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会把她吓走的！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.38,1:01:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那最好！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.32,1:01:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会说话吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.03,1:01:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,会
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.84,1:01:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真美
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.64,1:01:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 刚才是你在唱歌吗？ - 是
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.31,1:02:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我勇敢快乐的水手吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.12,1:02:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是 我是 - 斯克拉姆 控制！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.05,1:02:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们！我短暂悲惨的一生中
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.69,1:02:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没得到过什么 这是实话
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.23,1:02:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 上帝说
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.09,1:02:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯克拉姆可以吻一下美丽的人鱼！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.13,1:02:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 爱神之箭射中我心 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.04,1:02:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 金银财宝算什么 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.21,1:02:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 唯有你能给我慰藉 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.74,1:02:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 勇敢快乐的水手 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.35,1:02:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 来吧 美丽的少女 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.69,1:02:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 无论你是谁 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.39,1:02:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 只要你爱勇敢快乐的水手 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.09,1:02:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 他能劈开大海的怒涛 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.97,1:02:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 爱神之箭射中我心 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.24,1:03:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 金银财宝算什么 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.57,1:03:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 唯有你能给我慰藉 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.91,1:03:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 勇敢快乐的水手 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.42,1:03:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 爱神之箭射中我心 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.72,1:03:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 金银财宝算什么 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.09,1:03:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 唯有你能给我慰藉 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.30,1:03:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 勇敢快乐的水手 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.24,1:04:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,出现了！已经打上了！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.15,1:04:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,点火！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.18,1:04:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,鼓起勇气！赶她们上岸！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.20,1:05:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,撒网！快！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.15,1:06:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退！想活命就快上岸！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.89,1:06:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退！快！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.43,1:06:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,懦夫！回水里去！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.59,1:06:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,岸上没地方避难！听我的话！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.25,1:08:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到一个！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.69,1:08:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恋爱了！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.80,1:08:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查受伤的人鱼！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.36,1:08:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看还有没有活的！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.44,1:09:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 帮个忙！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.84,1:09:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好 水手
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.84,1:09:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家看到我跳了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.65,1:09:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可再也不跳了喔
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.78,1:09:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,回船上去 我们要驶到安全的港湾
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.34,1:09:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上帝 那是？ - 美人鱼
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.41,1:09:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放弃这疯狂的任务吧 - 不行
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.81,1:09:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走在沙滩上时
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.01,1:09:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,会回头看留下的两排脚印么？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.41,1:10:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经到这份儿上 不过我们被人捷足先登了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.55,1:10:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你只有一排脚印 - 白浪湾 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.49,1:10:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要加快速度
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.27,1:10:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们步行 吉布斯 你带路
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.94,1:10:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可是长官 那些人 - 他们已经死了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.24,1:10:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可他们还在叫喊 - 哦？是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.48,1:10:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可什么都没听到 只有海鸥在叫
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.95,1:10:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到什么了 格罗夫斯先生？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.78,1:10:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,海鸥…在叫
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.62,1:10:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没了 - 领路 吉布斯
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.33,1:10:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.07,1:10:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,领路 不然就领死
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.20,1:10:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个我都无所谓
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.61,1:11:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人员 前进！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.33,1:11:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该你了 斯派罗 - 有必要这样吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.97,1:11:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好不让你知道船的位置
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.77,1:11:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可是很谨慎的 - 我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.57,1:11:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最想要的…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.88,1:11:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,…是庞赛·莱昂德的船
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.05,1:12:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛要一路带着她？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.02,1:12:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为眼泪没法保存 得要新鲜的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.39,1:12:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个仪式需要什么来着？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.26,1:12:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不老泉的水和人鱼的眼泪？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.86,1:12:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有两只银杯
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.53,1:12:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只装人鱼眼泪 一只不装
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.44,1:12:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说 一只既装眼泪又装泉水？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.97,1:12:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好复杂啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.64,1:12:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,两只都装泉水 一只加眼泪
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.88,1:12:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝下有眼泪那杯水的人
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.65,1:12:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以得到另一个人的全部寿命
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.32,1:12:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少年？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.85,1:12:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有已经活过的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.96,1:12:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,和剩下没活的寿命 要是他寿命长的话
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.80,1:13:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,传教士
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.07,1:13:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一我有什么不测
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.14,1:13:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想现在就加入
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.88,1:13:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,个随便什么教
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.25,1:13:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让我也能去那种
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.15,1:13:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,伪教徒去的地方 懂了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.68,1:13:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有专门的说法 杰克 叫皈依
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.49,1:13:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得还用不着皈依
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.96,1:13:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,舵手！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.83,1:13:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 她不能呼吸了！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.70,1:13:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是有水吗 - 她需要空气！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.71,1:13:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打开 - 她会逃走的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.81,1:13:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她会死的 - 我与传教士立场一致
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.05,1:14:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.19,1:14:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.09,1:14:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我想的一样 走错了！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.62,1:14:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这条道 没错啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.19,1:14:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是没错 但是我们得从东边绕道
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.16,1:14:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就偏离去圣杯的路了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.16,1:14:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们会绕回来的 - 没时间绕了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.07,1:14:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你坚持要带那麻烦的人鱼的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.87,1:14:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有本事你再暴动啊 - 走路还扭扭的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.00,1:14:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你才扭扭的 - 必须有人去
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.17,1:14:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说分头走？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.84,1:14:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说跳崖？我等不及看好戏了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.88,1:15:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯派罗去吧 找到船 带回圣杯
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.05,1:15:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯派罗？你怎么确保他会回来？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.12,1:15:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是 你怎么确保他会回来？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.52,1:15:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不可信 父亲 我去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.86,1:15:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要去
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.60,1:15:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不老泉还有多远？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.10,1:15:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我时间不多了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.77,1:15:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,向北再走一天 沿着那条河
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.07,1:15:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,走到有一群小湖泊的地方 就不远了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.04,1:15:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.21,1:15:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道会这样
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.10,1:15:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说有人站在高处
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.40,1:15:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有想跳的冲动？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.24,1:15:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就没那种冲动
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.17,1:16:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要圣杯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.84,1:16:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪吧 省得我纠结跳不跳崖
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.48,1:16:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳下去 然后回来…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.85,1:16:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,…不然我就杀了她
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.65,1:16:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会杀亲生女儿的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.32,1:16:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,舵手 给我六把手枪
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.26,1:16:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,四把卸掉子弹 两把上膛
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.99,1:16:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉我是哪两把
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.77,1:16:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来选 斯派罗先生
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.14,1:16:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是它
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.54,1:16:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是它
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.68,1:16:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这把 - 确定？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.65,1:16:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.32,1:16:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,再选
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.89,1:16:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 这些都没装子弹
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.37,1:17:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,再选
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.50,1:17:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你这么想杀她
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.54,1:17:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干嘛不直接让她跳？ - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.71,1:17:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你跳下去摔死了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.34,1:17:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让她跳
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.15,1:17:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.85,1:17:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.89,1:17:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我跳下去 还能活吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.06,1:17:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,巫毒娃娃
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.75,1:17:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能 你能活 - 真是胡闹！我跳！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.24,1:18:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,湿透了 又湿透了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.77,1:18:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们继续 向北走到不老泉
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.51,1:18:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,合作愉快 父亲
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.61,1:18:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道哪把枪有子弹吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.65,1:18:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.30,1:18:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是有地图就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.20,1:18:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有船也行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.57,1:18:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住！千万别动！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.74,1:18:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让它碰到你的皮肤
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.99,1:19:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？老男人就不能有嗜好了？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.36,1:19:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还愣着干嘛啊？快走！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.03,1:19:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走！ - 等你死了再睡不迟
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.36,1:19:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.17,1:19:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,命运一直眷顾我们
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.30,1:19:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣地亚哥号
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.67,1:19:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,著名的庞赛·德莱昂船长的船
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.17,1:19:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.74,1:19:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.44,1:20:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能停
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.88,1:20:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己走
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.81,1:20:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.11,1:21:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不走就死
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.35,1:21:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,胳膊搭着我
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.72,1:21:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没叫人帮忙 - 但你需要
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.04,1:21:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是赶时间么？ - 别掉队
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.66,1:21:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,原地休息！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.48,1:22:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么美丽
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.48,1:22:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是上帝亲手创造的杰作
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.95,1:22:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像那些连方舟
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.02,1:22:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不容的邪恶生物
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.09,1:22:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么美丽…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.49,1:22:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,却又致命…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.10,1:22:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 致命？才不是 - 你袭击我
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.70,1:22:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有 你不一样
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.57,1:22:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不一样？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.91,1:22:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道不是吗？你会保护
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.35,1:22:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.05,1:22:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你把我推开的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.99,1:22:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看到不老泉了吗？ - 还没 不过已经近了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.03,1:22:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,带上那个东西 罩住它的头
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.03,1:23:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有名字！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.53,1:23:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿闻其详
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.27,1:23:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫瑟琳娜
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.12,1:23:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,庞赛·德莱昂
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.32,1:24:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算40个海盗做40个发财梦
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.19,1:24:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,也梦不到这屋里这么多的宝藏
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.90,1:24:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.23,1:24:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你 - 不…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.20,1:24:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你 - 我先来的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.61,1:24:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你 怎么会是你？ - 黑胡子送我来的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.78,1:24:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你呢？ - 为尊敬的陛下
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.41,1:24:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 取回圣杯 - 拜托
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.02,1:24:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后 退后！要保持平衡！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.79,1:24:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则整艘船都会滑下去的！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.16,1:24:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.93,1:24:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如我们各拿一个差不多重的东西？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.51,1:24:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,放回去！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.47,1:24:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也别动！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.45,1:25:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.59,1:25:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣杯
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.66,1:25:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！凭什么你先看啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.33,1:25:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.28,1:25:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一起 - 一起
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.55,1:25:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,石头
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.65,1:25:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是西班牙人
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.72,1:25:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,被他们抢先了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.32,1:25:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得看看那地图 就怕他们…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.67,1:25:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪 他们居然把这个留下了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.88,1:26:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰地图
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.02,1:26:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道路线
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.25,1:26:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我也知道他们会在哪里扎营
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.60,1:26:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.11,1:26:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉布斯 我正要去监狱救你
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.21,1:26:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你偷了我的地图
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.28,1:26:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 该走了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.79,1:26:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好嘞
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.71,1:27:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,人鱼
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.04,1:27:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 这些湖很深
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.11,1:27:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要是逃了 什么都白搭 舵手
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.32,1:27:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 给我看！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.19,1:27:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,被柱子钉死 被阳光晒干
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.29,1:27:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,一半身子在水里 活不了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.06,1:27:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,却会受尽折磨慢慢地死去
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.44,1:27:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.60,1:27:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类 为了收集泪水 杀死你的同胞
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.14,1:27:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑟琳娜 你就不想哭吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.35,1:27:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都会死的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.32,1:27:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听说你也快了 - 听…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.82,1:27:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.82,1:27:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到你姐妹们的尖叫了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.29,1:28:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.76,1:28:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只要一滴眼泪
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.44,1:28:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,卑鄙的生物！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.87,1:28:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 剁掉她的手指 一根一根剁！ - 抽死她！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.57,1:28:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,把眼泪给从她眼睛里挖出来！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.34,1:28:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么不说话了？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.54,1:28:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许日出后她会改主意
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.71,1:28:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 她会被晒死 但我等不及了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.78,1:28:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们该生一堆火
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.59,1:28:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行 - 不要挑战我 传教士
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.89,1:28:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不能折磨她 - 我们只要一滴眼泪
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.13,1:28:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要的话 我会把她身上的鱼鳞一片片刮下来
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.40,1:28:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不愿意就去祷告好了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.13,1:28:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我错了 不是所有灵魂都能得到救赎 你就不能
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.37,1:28:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧 各位 信仰多不靠谱
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.37,1:28:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你口中的卑劣的生物 胜过你一百倍
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.41,1:28:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦？你很在意她？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.18,1:28:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢她
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.88,1:28:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要否认 我看的清清楚楚
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.42,1:28:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.72,1:29:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,…她也喜欢你吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.96,1:29:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝 她喜欢 我们走运了！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.97,1:29:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,流一滴泪…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.37,1:29:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,…不然他就会死
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.04,1:29:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑟琳娜 如果你能流一滴泪
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.61,1:29:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.55,1:29:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,悲伤 没错
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.28,1:29:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但痛苦…还不够 - 你不能杀人 父亲！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.85,1:29:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间和潮汐都不等人 舵手
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.80,1:29:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 多坚强的人鱼
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.44,1:29:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,都一个德行
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.61,1:29:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她绑起来 把尸体丢掉
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.58,1:30:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有把握？ - 是
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.69,1:30:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是女人 我了解女人
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.70,1:30:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么想的 杰克？居然和巴博萨合作
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.80,1:30:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个女孩…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.70,1:30:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,…女人…异性
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.04,1:30:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你什么时候缺过女人了？ - 我是说“少女”
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.14,1:30:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要英雄救美？凡事都有第一次嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.31,1:30:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 不过我很久以前
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.68,1:30:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好像伤害了这位少女 - 直说吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.39,1:30:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉布斯 她是塞维利亚来的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.86,1:30:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你假装爱她 然后把她甩了 伤了人家的心
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.93,1:30:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,更糟 我可能 有一点点…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.80,1:30:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 心动… - 心动？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.07,1:31:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是心动 - 什么？你是说有感觉？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.21,1:31:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 也不算有感觉 就是…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.35,1:31:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 是有感觉 该死
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.09,1:31:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你还是离开了她 真卑鄙
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.22,1:31:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,承蒙夸奖
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.37,1:31:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能硬来
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.97,1:31:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来吧 你不太方便
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.84,1:31:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,腿里没长白蚁吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.84,1:31:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢关心 杰克
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.98,1:31:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我得一直跟着你
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.65,1:31:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,少校 你留在这等我信号
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.68,1:32:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边那个 一定是首领
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.92,1:32:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住他的帐篷 因为…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.89,1:32:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 上帝啊 那一定是圣杯
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.63,1:32:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的剑有怪味道
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.03,1:32:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 淬了箭毒蛙内脏的毒液
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.07,1:32:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要被划一下 几分钟准挂
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.31,1:32:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能别拿它对着我？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.78,1:32:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢蟾蜍
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.41,1:32:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在干嘛？ - 策划逃跑线路
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.99,1:32:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不总这样干么？ - 没错
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.19,1:32:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候我也…即兴发挥
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.32,1:33:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.69,1:33:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们溜达出去 淡定不要急
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.36,1:33:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太见外
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.62,1:34:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 瑟琳娜 - 菲利普 你还活着
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.02,1:34:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 你来救我
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.06,1:34:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.70,1:34:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不一样 不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.20,1:34:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂得仁慈和怜悯
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.76,1:35:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,悲伤的眼泪太难搞
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.89,1:35:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,人鱼都太顽强了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.46,1:35:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但快乐的眼泪…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.13,1:35:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说这种眼泪更有效
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.67,1:35:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑟琳娜 我发誓 我不知情
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.94,1:35:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,放她走吧 你已经不需要她了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.54,1:35:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,放她走？不行
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.61,1:35:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她绑紧 让她自生自灭吧
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.16,1:35:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的逃跑路线呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.29,1:35:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮到你即兴发挥了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.36,1:35:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在努力
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.83,1:35:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要弄松一只手
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.80,1:35:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你有把刀 太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.17,1:35:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,比刀更好
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.14,1:36:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也要
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.12,1:36:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是来复仇的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.49,1:36:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 复仇？ - 少来了 赫克托
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.06,1:36:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想要圣杯
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.63,1:36:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早就会发现它们不见了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.46,1:36:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在船上是想等黑胡子
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.60,1:36:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治国王 私掠船 假发
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.97,1:36:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,太小儿科了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.54,1:36:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可骗不过我 - 那晚你不在
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.54,1:36:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 弄丢黑珍珠 那晚？ - 是被抢 不是弄丢
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.98,1:36:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在伊斯帕尼奥拉海岸遭到突袭
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.29,1:36:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有原因 没有警告 也没人来谈判
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.86,1:36:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们遭到炮火的猛烈攻击
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.66,1:36:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 黑珍珠周围的海水开始翻滚
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.43,1:37:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑珍珠号在海浪中颠簸 剧烈地摇晃
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.00,1:37:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,每块木板 每条横栏
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.01,1:37:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,每根帆柱 突然都开始咯吱作响
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.01,1:37:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,绳索好像活了过来
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.18,1:37:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的船竟然开始攻击我们…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.01,1:37:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,…绳索缠住船员 像蛇一样绞着他们
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.42,1:37:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,也缠住了我的腿
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.99,1:37:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我的手还能动 手里握着剑
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.52,1:37:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长是我 不是黑胡子
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.19,1:37:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,掌握命运的是我 不是黑胡子
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.70,1:37:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我当机立断
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.91,1:37:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,活下来了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.41,1:37:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…你不是来找不老泉的
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.75,1:37:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,管他什么乔治国王
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.55,1:37:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么能治伤腿的偏方
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.42,1:38:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想用左手抓住黑胡子报仇
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.29,1:38:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么不是右手？ - 我要右手
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.40,1:38:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,把淬了毒液的刀子刺进他的心脏
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.04,1:38:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会帮你的 兄弟
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.22,1:39:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,犯人逃了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.82,1:39:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他逃了！快分头去抓他！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.66,1:39:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！快！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.83,1:39:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪！我要抓活的！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.91,1:39:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得那就是信号
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.95,1:40:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快！准备出击！ - 敌人正在逼近我们
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.19,1:40:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣杯的事对不住了 杰克 我有约在先
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.26,1:40:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不会回来了 - 没什么对不住的
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.40,1:40:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一起喝一杯？ - 去不老泉喝吧
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.79,1:41:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候你能不一见面就拿东西指着我？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.56,1:41:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣杯拿来了 斯派罗？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.59,1:41:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,对！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.67,1:41:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你带了个朋友 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.94,1:41:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个独腿男人就在附近 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.31,1:41:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.51,1:41:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.68,1:41:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我交出圣杯 有一两个条件
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.65,1:41:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说 - 首先
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.85,1:41:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的罗盘还我 哦不对 这是其次
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.35,1:41:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 你要保证
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.72,1:41:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会伤害安吉莉卡
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.85,1:41:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我不屑对你这种人发誓 斯派罗
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.36,1:41:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我也没什么损失
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.96,1:41:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来就不会伤害她
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.46,1:41:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就先谈其次
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.80,1:42:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗盘还我
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.34,1:42:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还我吧？这可是我的
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.50,1:42:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道抓住那只臭猪有多难吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.14,1:42:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是大的那个 四条腿的那只
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.95,1:42:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 那么第三 胡子先生
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.85,1:42:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,偶尔 虽然次数不多
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.69,1:42:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也会反省自己的种种恶行
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.96,1:42:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,最差劲的 就要数我一直亏待了吉布斯先生
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.36,1:42:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我忠心耿耿的大副 - 哈！现在想起我了啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.16,1:42:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把他丢在牢里 毫不关心
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.00,1:42:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我现在也不关心 但是我想说 你一定要放他自由
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.51,1:42:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就这样？ - 差不多吧
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.01,1:42:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 要是猪跑了 看你怎么拿圣杯
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.75,1:42:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 如果你觉得没差 我可就…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.35,1:42:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,成交
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.78,1:42:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,把猪放了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.79,1:43:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不介意的话 我愿意跟着你们…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.80,1:43:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会带你找到自由 兄弟
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.74,1:43:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓不老泉就在这附近
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.70,1:44:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能停下来
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.38,1:45:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,死胡同
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.82,1:45:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,死胡同
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.46,1:45:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,死胡同
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.89,1:45:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 我开始怀疑你根本不知道路
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.66,1:45:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们都说 过程比结果重要
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.70,1:45:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦把圣杯给我
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.18,1:45:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.07,1:45:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.77,1:46:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底有没有…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.84,1:46:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲眼见到过…不老泉？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.51,1:46:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 你能再问一遍么？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.85,1:46:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,舵手
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.25,1:46:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,别！别！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.89,1:46:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.29,1:46:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,“生命…之水”
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.10,1:47:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯克拉姆先生…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.77,1:47:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帮个忙？ - 这样？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.33,1:48:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,真美
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.81,1:48:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯派罗 我要第一个喝这泉水
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.92,1:48:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.79,1:49:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,独腿人
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.63,1:49:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你带他来这的 - 我干嘛要这么做？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.73,1:49:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华·蒂奇！
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.97,1:49:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,鉴于你在公海犯下的累累罪行
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.40,1:49:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,国王陛下授权于我…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.41,1:49:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,…外加我们之间颇为深重的个人恩怨…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.74,1:49:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我在此依法拘捕你
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.95,1:49:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,并宣布你是我的罪犯
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.32,1:49:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没戏唱了 是吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.99,1:49:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你犯的罪行包括 海上掠夺 叛国
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.53,1:49:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谋杀 施酷刑
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.83,1:49:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有残忍夺走他人右腿罪
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.54,1:49:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…还敢面对这把剑？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.41,1:49:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在离你的船这么远的地方 当然敢
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.98,1:50:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 尽管我可能命不久矣
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.85,1:50:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我也要决一死战 以上帝的名义！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.65,1:50:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他们！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.02,1:50:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.96,1:50:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我们先把话说明白
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.00,1:50:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你们要打他们
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.50,1:50:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要打你们
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.97,1:50:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,只因为他想要杀了他？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.80,1:50:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没道理啊！是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.88,1:50:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我说 就让他们单打独斗 我们就坐边上
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.78,1:50:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝喝小酒 打打小赌 看看好戏！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.32,1:50:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.19,1:50:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杀了他们！ - 一个不留！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.29,1:51:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.92,1:51:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯克拉姆 圣杯！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.09,1:51:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着眼泪！跟我来！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.23,1:51:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.33,1:52:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,把眼泪交出来 乖
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.00,1:52:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,比起你我更怕她
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.88,1:52:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,把眼泪交出来 乖
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.65,1:52:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不介意的话 把圣杯给我 - 抱歉 杰克
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.55,1:52:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过 我需要寿命 你的就可以
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.70,1:52:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯克拉姆！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.59,1:52:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑟琳娜…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.79,1:53:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦上帝 不要带走她
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.70,1:53:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算你已带走她 也请让她活过来
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.80,1:53:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她活过来…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.30,1:53:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,活过来…求你了…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.76,1:53:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为命运之神会再眷顾你们一些的
Dialogue: 0,1:53:57.38,1:54:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了你 看你还能不能笑得出来
Dialogue: 0,1:54:02.59,1:54:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,看后面 爱德华·提切
Dialogue: 0,1:54:36.22,1:54:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这片土地永远属于
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.69,1:54:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,尊敬的乔治国王陛下…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.50,1:54:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会铭记他的英勇
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.41,1:55:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 请交出圣杯
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.83,1:55:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有上帝才能赐予生命永恒 而非这异教的泉水
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.55,1:55:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,摧毁这亵渎上帝的庙宇！
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.79,1:55:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不老泉！
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.17,1:55:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个蠢货
Dialogue: 0,1:55:58.84,1:56:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所追求的 只有信仰才能赐予你
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.24,1:56:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,信仰？信仰之光不足以照亮
Dialogue: 0,1:56:04.91,1:56:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我眼前的黑暗
Dialogue: 0,1:56:10.78,1:56:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:17.02,1:56:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为黑珍珠号报仇 - 你干了什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:23.16,1:56:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,安吉莉卡！别碰！有毒！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:30.20,1:56:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,要对付黑胡子还不耍一些卑劣的小手段
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.67,1:56:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没那么笨
Dialogue: 0,1:56:37.38,1:56:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.69,1:56:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宣布 用黑胡子的船和船员
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.89,1:56:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及这把剑 作为我断腿的补偿！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.74,1:57:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住！拉！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:57.42,1:57:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别浪费我的眼泪
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.25,1:58:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝了这个 这里面有眼泪
Dialogue: 0,1:58:31.52,1:58:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你得喝另一杯 - 不！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:34.29,1:58:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救不了你们两个 必须有一个人牺牲
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.46,1:58:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喝这个 父亲 为了你的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,1:58:43.60,1:58:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒂奇船长 她快死了 你得救你女儿
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.21,1:58:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这杯会夺走生命？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.14,1:58:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这杯有眼泪的能获得永生？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:55.15,1:58:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 快点！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:05.32,1:59:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,安吉莉卡…救救我 孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:59:11.50,1:59:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.64,1:59:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 父亲
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.05,1:59:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:59:39.86,1:59:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 我可能说错了
Dialogue: 0,1:59:43.53,1:59:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这杯里有眼泪 另一杯是泉水
Dialogue: 0,1:59:47.47,1:59:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗子！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.87,1:59:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 魔鬼！ - 父亲！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:57.74,1:59:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋！你怎么能这样！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.28,2:00:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲救了你
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.88,2:00:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这样他的灵魂就能得到救赎了
Dialogue: 0,2:01:05.21,2:01:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受伤了
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.55,2:01:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是肉体的伤而已
Dialogue: 0,2:01:13.15,2:01:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的心很平静…因为你
Dialogue: 0,2:01:18.46,2:01:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我？ - 是
Dialogue: 0,2:01:22.33,2:01:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾迷失了自己
Dialogue: 0,2:01:25.70,2:01:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,海风 浪潮…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:30.50,2:01:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,…本能令人重拾信仰
Dialogue: 0,2:01:35.14,2:01:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但对我来说 只有你能
Dialogue: 0,2:01:37.98,2:01:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲利普 我可以救你
Dialogue: 0,2:01:41.85,2:01:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你求我
Dialogue: 0,2:01:46.25,2:01:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只求一件事 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,2:01:52.06,2:01:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我
Dialogue: 0,2:01:54.56,2:01:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是我 你不会被抓
Dialogue: 0,2:01:58.03,2:01:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,求我
Dialogue: 0,2:02:01.57,2:02:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.53,2:02:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨你
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.89,2:02:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可救了你哎
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.36,2:02:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的生命 是从我亲生父亲那偷来的！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:35.70,2:02:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是帮黑胡子做了一个父亲该做的事
Dialogue: 0,2:02:38.87,2:02:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又冷血又无知
Dialogue: 0,2:02:45.78,2:02:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,一把手枪 一发子弹
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.71,2:02:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我在饿死前自杀？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:52.08,2:02:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我信不过你 亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.79,2:02:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外 这是一条商路
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.39,2:02:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以向过路的船只求救
Dialogue: 0,2:02:58.12,2:03:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么就扣扳机自杀 随你便
Dialogue: 0,2:03:01.73,2:03:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我怎么给自己松绑？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:03.46,2:03:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你半小时前就挣脱了
Dialogue: 0,2:03:06.33,2:03:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就等着好时机来攻击我
Dialogue: 0,2:03:11.87,2:03:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,承认吧 杰克
Dialogue: 0,2:03:13.67,2:03:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还爱我 - 如果你还有个妹妹和小狗
Dialogue: 0,2:03:17.74,2:03:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会选小狗
Dialogue: 0,2:03:20.21,2:03:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝藏！我有一箱珠宝！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:23.68,2:03:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,足够让你称霸海上！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:26.08,2:03:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你就扯吧！ - 等等…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.99,2:03:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有了 是你的
Dialogue: 0,2:03:34.93,2:03:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不记得我们有过…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:36.46,2:03:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你喝多了！ - 我还不至于那么多
Dialogue: 0,2:03:39.33,2:03:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:42.33,2:03:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有话要跟你说
Dialogue: 0,2:03:44.57,2:03:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一次见到你时就想说了
Dialogue: 0,2:03:49.67,2:03:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就 说吧
Dialogue: 0,2:03:53.14,2:03:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你
Dialogue: 0,2:03:58.05,2:03:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,2:04:00.02,2:04:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直爱你 永远爱你
Dialogue: 0,2:04:07.99,2:04:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得闪了
Dialogue: 0,2:04:09.63,2:04:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:12.96,2:04:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没完呢！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:15.63,2:04:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:26.28,2:04:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,偏啦！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:43.06,2:04:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,安妮女王复仇号 是我的了！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:52.77,2:04:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官…
Dialogue: 0,2:04:56.71,2:04:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,在船舱里找到的
Dialogue: 0,2:05:24.67,2:05:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体船员！迎风航行！
Dialogue: 0,2:05:27.07,2:05:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,快干活 你们这些臭虫！
Dialogue: 0,2:05:33.34,2:05:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,王室待我不薄
Dialogue: 0,2:05:36.08,2:05:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在海神和苍天的见证下…
Dialogue: 0,2:05:39.22,2:05:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,驶向托儿图加港吧！
Dialogue: 0,2:05:54.43,2:05:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉布斯 你这个死鬼 你成功了！
Dialogue: 0,2:05:57.74,2:05:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错！
Dialogue: 0,2:05:59.44,2:06:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看我们可以合开个公司了
Dialogue: 0,2:06:01.17,2:06:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准能挣大钱 - 睁大眼睛看吧
Dialogue: 0,2:06:10.41,2:06:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗盘直接把我带到那地方
Dialogue: 0,2:06:13.08,2:06:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑胡子的守卫呢？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:15.19,2:06:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用了在新几内亚学的那招防御术
Dialogue: 0,2:06:19.19,2:06:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不把整个舰队都带来就白瞎了
Dialogue: 0,2:06:23.43,2:06:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实白瞎
Dialogue: 0,2:06:37.44,2:06:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨这猴子
Dialogue: 0,2:06:38.94,2:06:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你知道怎么把黑珍珠号弄出来么？
Dialogue: 0,2:06:42.51,2:06:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要十字弓 沙漏和三只山羊
Dialogue: 0,2:06:45.68,2:06:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人吹小号 另一个跳大神…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:49.22,2:06:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我认识一个人有山羊 - 太好了 我可以来这个
Dialogue: 0,2:06:55.16,2:06:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 我很想知道…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:56.96,2:06:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有圣杯 泉水和人鱼眼泪…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:59.96,2:07:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本可以永生的
Dialogue: 0,2:07:02.63,2:07:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是不老泉的考验 吉布斯
Dialogue: 0,2:07:04.77,2:07:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好还是别知道自己的死期
Dialogue: 0,2:07:07.81,2:07:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样你每时每刻
Dialogue: 0,2:07:09.97,2:07:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,都在探索生命的神秘
Dialogue: 0,2:07:13.21,2:07:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说我不会永生呢？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:15.88,2:07:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不老泉的发现者
Dialogue: 0,2:07:19.15,2:07:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是我吹的 吉布斯
Dialogue: 0,2:07:22.19,2:07:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就喜欢当海盗
Dialogue: 0,2:07:25.12,2:07:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了吧？
